<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 16:41:19 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Bata</para>
  <para style="toc1">Langkegaime Bata</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bata</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bat.</para>
  <para style="mt">Acts</para>
  <para style="mt">Langkegaime Bata</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Langkegaime Bata aide Luke ne raukegai maha pe kenabe. Anuide peu Khristianme ngqwa dainzwa ndeulu nah mmipet lubi kesangbe cilu kerane raugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide keraide langkegaibe kena Peter penai Paul bata ha raugai. Peter ne pe mpaube tei eh Jerusalem ngqwa kendeu gade heta tei nah Paul becai zierang kemlangbe tei eh deudi kennadung ga mina dage Khrista ha pau kerane tetpet kegaibe. Bata aide de “Kemci Rabe Bata” lie eh de qu lubui kedanemene cide Rabe gwang kera nah pe bata ha ledeu kebeune.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bata laisiukwak ngqwa kerai aide ha makie kecum ledeu beu: 1) ngqwa kerai aide samlia daibi kecu; 2) dainzwa Jewme samlia aide mlai dibi kecu nah dainzwa Tinggwang langkegaime de Gentileme dage langgai bi kecu; 3) ngqwa kerai aide dade reketme nah, Romme zai dainzwa dibi kecu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io">Khrista kelamna dau keledeusamdung (1:1-11)</para>
  <para style="io">Jerusalem ga ngqwabe (1:12-8:1)</para>
  <para style="io">Palestine ga di kepet (8:2-12:25)</para>
  <para style="io">Paul zierangketei beuh keraibe (13:1-14:28)</para>
  <para style="io">Jerusalem ga baudi (15:1-35)</para>
  <para style="io">Paul zierangketei beuh kenabe (15:36-18:22)</para>
  <para style="io">Paul zierangketei beuh kecumbe (18:23-19:41)</para>
  <para style="io">Paul Jerusalem nah Caesarea ga (20:1-26:32)</para>
  <para style="io">Rome ga Paul bata (27:1-28:31)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Jisu de Tinggim ga teucuh kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Theophilus, Ih laisiukwak keraibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ih laisiukwak keraibe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luke ne raukegai samliakeyi. </char></note> gage, Jisu pe ta tei cuhdi kecu nah ledeu kegaidung de peciakne Ih raugai dida, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />pecu ngngwa nghangdi kecu tingba kecang, pa Kemci Rabe gade pa ne kedetkelu langkegaimedung dage ajadung peu kedicai. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Pe tsitcai, pa ring kebam, nlumlu kebui batadung kekiee ge gade penui dage pecu liagai. Zie riakdai ge penuide peu pecu ngaugai, nah pa Tinggwang hegwangram ha ranglia gai. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Piage penui ngngwa matyei kebam dau, pa penuide aja kaigai, “Jerusalem pütdi so, Ih nnuide pedwa rang kebeu nzwa, peibe sampet kebeu mapeu de langgai beu kemaktane kwa bamlu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 24:49</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />John dui le mide duipum tei, dede zie kiee kemakcai nnuide Kemci Rabe gade duipum tei dizie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 3:11</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Langkegaimedung ngkwa ncüt keludau, penui Jisu de keteugai, “Rampaubo, nang Israel de hegwangram peu dai kera aipau ting de deni?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Dede Pa penui dage rangdi, “Peibe pe kengkieng gade peting mede pehidung riempwa kebamde nnui ci kerane ma. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Dede Kemci Rabe nnui da gwang lude, nnui kengkieng ngau luzie nah nnui Jerusalem, Judea nah Samaria pelane ga nah kideu penli ga kecang a zierang teizie.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Pa aidungde rang kedicai, penui ngangcuh pie kebamdau, pecu ngngwa cuhdi, nah hemwa gene penui miakngau gade pecu sung teudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 47:5</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pa nghang kecu penui tinggimle pie lingci eh kebamdau, zette, mi hangna penai nia keha teulwe penui taiga sapdi. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Penai rangdi, “Galileeme peidung, daitei nnui tinggim pie eh sap bamno? Nnui dade tinggim ga ngngwa nghang kedi Jisu aipaude, pa tinggim nghang kedi nnui kengau kesiakge cailigwang daizie.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas bam leu kera Mathias de kedetkelu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Pecai penui Olive lie qu kela lamlwa gade Jerusalem namdi ga cailigwanglu, cide Jerusalem namdi taiga, Sabbath naige beuh dei ge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sabbath naige beu tie ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilometer ge dei ge</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Penui namdi ga gwang luge, penui kebam kibung nreube de ga nghanglu, Peter penai John, nah James penai Andrew, Philip penai Thomas, Bartholomew penai Matthew, Alphaeus napei James penai Zealot lie kela Simon, nah James napei Judas. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Penui pelane ngngwa ket tei eh kekie tei bamla, mipuime nah Jisu pui Mary, nah Jisu sinamedung de si eh.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Cipau tingdau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cipau tingdau: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Jisu tinggim nghang kedicai nah Pentecost tingba kakde de rangbam. </char></note> Peter sinamedung kakga saplu, (mina ngkwa kebam pelane ge 120 kenzwage) delwe Peter rangdi, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Mipeimedung, sinamedung, Kemci Rabe ne David mui gade Judas, Jisu de ketuime de saulia kebeube ha rangkenzeu de kesanglaisiu ga teicang maisiadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 41:9</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Kedanemene Judas anui kakga peupei hangge nah aipau zierangta dega pade pe qwabam.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Aipau peide pe ta kesia gade rangkang ngau kelude teu luh ge luilu, nah cikade pa tsaidi. Pe peu taksu hia rai nah pe za pangpop gai eh pe lungnetdung mpet ciaudi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Aide Jerusalem ga kelunghme pelane de ci gwangdi, cine penui cipau luh de “Akeldama,” de penui let gade qudi, cide pekie “Hejai Luh.”) <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Kedanemene cide Leidung Laisiukwak ga raupwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Peu aipau luh de mta dilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Nah migede depeu cika lungh so,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 69:25</char></note> nah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Peu mi kedage depeu pe muiteubam ga bam dilu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 109:8</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Cine anui Rampaube Jisu de ngngwa kegwang kemie leune ga anuide nzang kelame hangge maisia, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />John duipum ketei gade gwang anui dade pecu ngngwa nghang kedi benai kecang—aidungde gade mige anuide ngngwa pa ringcuh kedi zierang tei maisia.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Cine penui mi hangna de kedetlu, Barsabbas lie qukela Joseph, pecu Justus liede qula nah Matthias. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Cine kekie teilu eh, penui rangdi, “Rampaubo, nang mileune mlung ci, cine aipau kena kakgade nang caube de kedetlubi kecu lialo <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />aipau zierangta ga nah langkegaita ga Judas, pe saja bam gage tetgai kedibe bam leulu kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Penai ziemne penui dacak tei, nah dacak Matthias reuga gwangdi, cine pecu langkegaime kereieket baude silu.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Pentecost dau Kemci Rabe kegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Pentecost tingba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pentecost tingba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Jisu tinggim nghang kedicai nah Pentecost tingba kakga de rangbam.</char></note> benai, kenlumme pelane heni gega ngkwabam. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ge zette tinggim gade tingkai guisüt kecu kenzwa makwa ge gwang, nah cide ne penui ntum kebam ki pelane de puidi. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Cidau cika mi mleudung nzwa pet, nah cidungde penui hangge ge reuga gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Penui pelane Kemci Rabe le puidi eh helet kedadung gade marangdi, Kemci Rabe penuide ranglu kebui kepeune.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Cipau tingdau Jewme, tinggim kang heleuh leune gade renet lam mting kelamedung Jerusalem ga lungh bam. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Makwa aide siu luge, mina maadi gwang hekwalu nah penui swagahdi, kedanemene mi hange ge kecu penui let rip gade marang kebam siu kelune. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Penui pekiene de penui ma canghdi nah penui swagahdi; nah penui hange ge dage rangdi, “Pielo, Marang kebam aidungde pelane Galileeme meni? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Cine dainzwa anui mi hange ge kecu pekatei pe ramme let rip gade penui kerang siu zeu no? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Parthiame nah Mediame nah Elamme, nah Mesopotamia, Judea nah Cappodocia ga kelunghme, Pontus nah Asia ga, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Phrygia nah Pamphylia si eh, Egypt ga nah Libya cuikui Cyrene lebie kelunghme nah Rome gade mbeuh gwang kelame, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Jewme nah Jewme renet mzai kedimedung, Creteme nah Arabiame. Nah anui Tinggwang bata kedi tei kegaidung penui anui let gade rang kebam siu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Cine penui pelane penui macangh nah kebwakdi eh hangge ge dage rangdi, “Aide pekie daino?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Dede midungge penuide henui tei eh rangdi, “Penui au zau sakmie dida.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter maadibe dage kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Dede Peter mina kereieket baude ngngwa saplu delwe penui dage sahbak eh rangdi, “Judeamedung nah nnui Jerusalem ga lungh kebam pelane, acu peu aipau kiede nnui dage ranglia lo; a samdung kingnei sünne lu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Kedanemene mina aidungde nnui kecet nzwa zau sakmie ma, cu au tingcang bam hekui gwale mereu. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Dede aide caihakecibe Joel ne kerang deda:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Peting kekam lebie ainzwa dizie,’ Tinggwang rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">‘Mina leune dage Ih a Rabe ruigai zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Nnui napeime nah nnui napuime caihakecisam rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nah nnui rehangme marengeidung ngau zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nah nnui kecingpeidung hemangdung mmi zie.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Cipau tingdau a kilame, mipei nah mipui dage</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">Ih a Rabe ruigai beuzie, nah penui caihakecisam rang zie.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ih nreule tingkam gade miswakegahdung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Miswakegahdung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang ne tei kegai marehidung nah miswakegah batadung.</char></note> teilia zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">nah ngkangle kideu gade marehidung teilia zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">hejai nah mi nah mika cuidung.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Tingnaimiak mui dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">nah hekei hejai nzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">Rampaube tingba kedi nah kendu de kegwang dwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Iciu eh keheibede Rampaube zi qu kegaime de kelilu zie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joe. 2:28-32</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Israelmedung, sam aidungde kingnei lulo: Tinggwang pe bata kedi, miswakegah nah marehidung gade Nazarethme Jisu de nnui dage keulia ndu gaida, cide Tinggwang nnui kakga de teigai, nnui cibam nzwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Mina aipaude de, Tinggwang pa mrairiem teukela nah cetnswa teukela nzwa pecu mina kesiame ba gage kaigai beudi, nah nnui pecu cross gage gwak tsetdi. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Pa au Tinggwang ne kwakcuh kelube ddeda, iciu eh ketsai rei gade pecu lungmpet beu, kedanemene pecu ketsai ne kaam nzeugai lakdi. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Hegwangpei David pe ha rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Ih Rampaube de a dwaga ngau muila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">kedanemene pa a ba zetlebie ga bamla iciu eh peu acu mlaidi melu kerane.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Aide ziemne, a lung pesui yi nah a mleu pesui yila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Kesang, a pumteih de keregui aide ga lungh luzie.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Kedanemene nang a rabe de ketsaime deu gage gi dilak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">mede n Kemci kilabe depeu herau gade tim dilak.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Nang kering lampuidung acu liagaida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">nang acu ngngwa la eh peu acu a suiyi le pui zie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 16:8-11</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Mipeimedung, sinamedung, Ih nnui dage anui pau David ha rangkera puikaam gede gah. Pa tsaidi eh pecu kungdi, nah henai kecangde pe rau anuida bam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Heg. 2:10</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Pa au caihakecime ge nah Tinggwang pecu ngngwa sampet kelude pa ci, cide cai peu pe leuhme gede pe hegwangbam ga bamkera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 132:11</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Paucai teigwang kerabe ngau eh pa Khrista ringcuhdai kecu ha ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Pecu ketsaime deu gage gigai dima, mede pe pumteih herau gade tim dima.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 16:10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Jisu aipaude de Tinggwang kwakcuh luda, nah cide ga anui pelane zierangme da. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Cine pecu peu Tinggwang ba zetle bam dida, nah peibe dade Kemci Rabe ngau luda, pa sampet kebeu nzwa. Nnui ngau nah siu kebam aide pa nnui dage rui gaibeu da.<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kedanemene David Tinggim ga nghang kecube ma, dede pa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Rampaube a Rampaube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rampaube a Rampaube: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">samria aika Rampaube au Peibe Tinggwang da nah a Rampaube de kecu au Jisu de rangbam; Jisu de ketsai gade teu cuhlu eh Tinggwang ne pecu Rampaube nah Messiah teigai. </char></note> dage rangdi, “A ba zetle bamlu,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Ih n ngauraume de pwa n pidau teidi kemaktane.”’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 110:1</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Ciziemne, nnui gwak kedi Jisu aipaude de, Tinggwang pecu Rampaube nah Khrista tei kedi Israelme pelane de peu cisiakte lulo.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Cu penui aide siu luge penui lung kehereidi, delwe Peter nah langkegaime kedame dage rangdi, “Sinamedung, anui dai tei laino?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Cidau Peter penui de keligai, “Helungnreulu, nah duipum teilu, nnui hangge ge kecu Jisu Khrista zi gade nnui maudung gilu kerane, iciude nnui Kemci Rabe mapeude ngau luzie. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kedanemene sampet aide au nnui, nnui name nah kemdei ga kelame pelane ziemne nah Rampaube anui Tinggwang pe dage qugai kelu leune ziemne.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joe. 2:32</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Pa sam keda kekiee teu zierang teigai nah penuide kecung eh ranggai, “Aipau ceheu kesiade gade nnuide kelilu lo.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Cine pe sam nlum kelume duipum teilu, nah cipaunai mina cangcum ge nlumkelume maa ga silu.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlumme kangbau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Pecai penui langkegaime keledeu sam kingnei, ngngwa kekangbau nah ketaktyei nah kekie ketei jüja bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Mina pelane reu kengngi gwangdi, nah langkegaimedung miswakegah nah mimakecangh bata kekiee ge teigai. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Nlum kelume pelane ngngwa ket teidi nah ma pelane ga ngngwa kemacütdi, <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />nah penui penui gunia nah mabamdung zwalwe, cidungde teumaikesiame de mzi beudi. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Penui tingba ramsang ne kerecaki ga gwang ngkwala, nah penui kidung gade tangku tei poplwe penui suiyi nah ket tei eh ngngwa ketak tyeila, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Tinggwang de twa nah mina pelane de ngngwa kezuyi bamdi. Nah Rampaube Tingba ramsangne kelikelume de penui maa gage si gaibeu bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Peter ha tyeikela pi kesia pei gede teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Tingnaige Peter penai John kekie ketei ting, tingna bam cum ting dauge kerecaki ga hangla. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Cu mipei ge mna kelu gade pe pi sia kebam gede pwa gwangla, pecu tingba ramsangne kerecaki rieki Hezukeyi de eh qukela gage kaila, iciu eh pa kerecaki ga kegwangme dade rangkang halu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Pa Peter penai John kerecaki ga lütlai eh kebam ngau luge, pa penai dade pecu rangkang peulo kiedi. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Dede Peter penai John, pecu pielingci gai eh rangdi, “Anaide pielu.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Cine pe pi kesiabe peide penai dade mage ngaulu kera nlum eh penaide pie bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Dede Peter rangdi, “Ih rangkanggeu nah kecak gede gah, dede Ih kebambe, aide Ih ncu peuzie. Nazarethme Jisu Khrista zi gade cuhlwe tetlu.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Peter zetle ba le pecu gielwe teuncuh lu, ge zette pe pi nah pe piki ngkienglu. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Cidau pi kesiabe peide nsau cuh saplu delwe tetdi; nah pa penaide ngngwa kerecaki ga lütdi, tet nah nsün nah Tinggwang de twa eh. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Mina leune pa tet nah Tinggwang de twa kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Penui pa kerecaki Hezukeyi rieki ga bam eh mina dade rangkang ha bam kelabe pei delie cilu; nah penui peda teikedi de ziemne penui swagah nah penui macangdi.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter minadung dage sam kerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Pa Peter penai John de gielwe kebamdau, mina pelane penui swagah süt eh Solomon kigu lie qukela ga penui taiga pakgwang. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Peter aide ngau luge, minadung dage ranggai, “Israelmedung, daitei aide ngau nnui swagah bamno? Mede daitei nnui anuide pielingci eh bamno, anai anai kengkieng le mede kenlum keyi le pecu peu tetkelu nzwa? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Abraham Tinggwang,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham Tinggwang: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang de Abraham Tinggwang lie eh qula kedanemene Abraham pecu le pwane pe Tinggwang lie la kecune. </char></note> nah Isaac Tinggwang, nah Jacob Tinggwang, nah anui peime Tinggwang, pe kilabe Jisu de tei ndulia gaida, nnui pecu Pilate ba gage tuigai nah pe dwade pecu mlai kedibe de, Pilate pecu püt gaibeu kera cetlu liede. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Dede nnui Kemci nah Kesamsangbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kesamsangbe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hezaibe gade petau kelabe. </char></note> de mlaidi nah mide dapketsetbe de nnuide lungmpet beulo kiedi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Dede nnui keringria Bangdwabe de teitsetdi, Tinggwang ketsai gade kwakcuh kelubede, nah anui au aide zierangme da. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Cu, pe zi kenlum gade, nnui ci nah ngau kebam mina aipaude de tei ngkeing lulie. Jisu zi gade nah pe dade kepet kenlum de ne nnui pelane dwa gade mina aipaude de tei mmi cang beuda. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Cu, sinamedung, nnui muiteumedung tei kedinzwa, nnuide ci mene teimau kedi, Ih cibam. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Dede Tinggwang caihakecime pelane mui gade Khrista keherei zielie mrairang kegaide, pa ainzwa teicang luda. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Cine, helungnreulu, nah nreu caililu, iciu eh nnui maudung teinggah dilu kerane, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />iciu eh Rampaube dade teikemcang ting gwanglu kerane; nah pa nnui ziemne kedet pwa kebambe de langgailu kerane, cide Khrista Jisu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Tinggwang ndaa pe kemci caihakecimedung dade rang kegai nzwa, ma pelane teihemi dailu kemaktane pa tinggim ga bamlu maisia. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Moses ranggai kesangda, ‘Rampaube nnui Tinggwang nnui siname kakgade caihakeci Ih kenzwa gede teucuh beuzie. Nnui ma pelane ga pe kwa kingnei zie—pa nnui dage kerangbe leune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 18:15-18</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Dede keheibe de caihakecibe kwa kingnei kemakbe de mina kakgade ngkap dizie.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Kesang, caihakecime pelane Samuel gade gwang pecai kegwangmedung kekiee ge cudau ting ha mrairang gaida. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Nnui caihakecime nah Tinggwang nnui paume dage samkak kelu name da. Tinggwang Abraham dage, ‘N leuh gade kideu ga mina pelane de samlam beuzie,’ de ranggai. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Tinggwang pe kilabe de teucuh kelucai, pa pecu nnui dage langgai raibeu, nnui pelane de nnui kenlien gade teu nreulu eh nnuide samlam beu kerane.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Peter penai John sanhedrin dwaga kesap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Peter penai John minadung dage marang kebamdau, cingkumedung nah kerecaki kekwame reu kedibe nah Sadduceemedung penai da gwang. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Penuide kebwak sütdi kedanemene Peter penai John Jisu ketsai gade ringcuh daikelu ha mina de ledeu nah ranglia kebamne. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ciziemne penui penaide tuilu delwe hebaangki gage pecai benai tingcang kemaktane kaizeudi, cipau hidau tinghegi di kecune. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Dede mina kekiee ge samlia siu kelume Jisu de nlumlu; nah nlumkelume mina cang mengei kenzwa ge.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Pecai benai penui reu kedimedung nah hangkiamedung nah laisiukecime Jerusalem ga gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Cingkupei kedibe Annas, nah Caiaphas, nah John, nah Alexander, nah cingku kedibe kelak pelane si eh bam. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Peter penai John de penui kakga ngngwagwang kelucai, penui penaide keteudi, “Daipai kengkieng gade, mede cau zi gade nnai aide teilu no?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Cidau Peter Kemci Rabe le puipung eh penui sam keligai, “Nnui mina reu kedimedung nah hangkiamedung,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kedimedung nah hangkiamedung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peter Sanhedrin de herüt peu sünne eh ranggai. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />anai dade henai kemnoime dage bata keyi tei kegai nah pecu dainzwa tei ngkeilu dibi keteucai, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />aide peu nnui pelane nah Israelme pelane de ci lulo, cide Nazarethme Jisu Khrista, pecu nnuine gwaktsetdi, dede Tinggwang ketsai gade teucuh kebeube zi gade lie, pe ziemne mina aipaude yimcang eh nnui dwaga sapbam delie. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Jisu Khrista au nnui ki keteime mlai kedi tangtsu deda, dede cide keu kimiaktsu tei dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 118:22</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kelikelu au mige dade gah, kedanemene Tinggwang tinggim kangga minadung kakga hezi keda gede anuide kelilu kera peu melu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Penui Peter penai John kuusüt kecu ngau luge, nah penai laisiu cikemak, nah maidakme gelie kecu ci luge penui swagahdi, nah penui penai Jisu de ngngwala kecu cilu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Dede yikelube pei penaide ngngwa sap kebam ngau luge, penui penaide magede rangmsia kera gahdi. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Dede penui langkegaibe kena de kempau kangbau gade mpet dilo aja kai kedicai, penui katei penui kakga kempaudi. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Penui rangdi, “Anui aipau pei kena de teu dai teilai? Kedanemene penai miswakegah bata tei kegaide Jerusalem ga kelunghme leune ci pet dida, nah anui cide malie dau lakta. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Dede minadung kakga rangmdi si melu kerane, anui penaide hezi aide teu mida gede marang sita lulo kaambi di golie.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Cine Peter penai John de kilung ga qu nlütlwe, penaide Jisu zi teu marang mede ledeu tadi lulo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Dede Peter penai John penui sam keligai, “Tinggwang dwade Tinggwang samzai tei kera swade nnui sam mzai kerabe petau mi, nnui cet lulo. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kedanemene anui ngau nah siu kelube rangme gai laklu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Penui Peter penai John de keheu gai eh penaide peu tetdi. Minadung ziemne penui penaide teikeherei dau lakdi, kedanemene penai tei kegai ziemne mileune Tinggwang de twabam kedine. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Kedanemene teingkei kelu miswakegah bata aide mmi riakdai swade cing kedi peige dage tei kegaine.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlumme kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Dede penaide lungmpet kebeu cai, Peter penai John penai zangme da gwang eh cingku kedime nah hangkiamedung penai dage kerang samdung pelane paubeu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Penui cide siu luge, penui kwa ge tei eh Tinggwang dade kie, “Oh Kengkieng Rampaubo, tinggim, kideu, jaaidi, nah cika kela leune tei kegaibo. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Nang Kemci Rabe gade anui pau n kilabe David mui gade marang gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Daipai kie ziemne Gentileme penui rata lano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">nah minadung heciem kesiadung cetmning lano?’<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />‘Kideu hegwangmedung penui sap ga saplu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">nah kedimedung gwang ngkwalu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">Rampaube, nah pe Messiah de renia kerane.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Lei. 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kesang, Herod nah Pontius Pilate, Gentilemedung nah Israelmedung ngngwalwe n kemci kilabe Jisu, nang keniak kelube de renia eh namdi Jerusalem ga gwang ngkwalu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa. 61:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />N kengkieng nah n lungning gade tei zielie mrairiem teukela pelane tei kera penui gwang ngkwalu da. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Cu, Rampaubo, penui mide keheu kecudungde pielo, nah n kilame de peu kuusüt eh n sam ranglo. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ciziemne mide tei ngkeilu kera n ba hwagailo, nah peu mimakecangh nah miswakegah batadung n kilabe kemci Jisu zi gade teilo.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Penui kekie teicang dige, penui ngngwa ngkwa kebam ni de nlaidi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nlaidi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnui teu kecu mede tingkai ne tsingbang gui nlaigai kecunzwa nlai kecude rangbam. </char></note> nah penui pelane Kemci Rabe le kepui teilwe penui kuusüt eh Tinggwang sam rangdi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlummedung penui mabam kencüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Nlum kelumedung maadibe ngngwa lung ge nah sui ge teidi. Migede pe mabam pwa pekatei pegu lie tadi, dede penui ma pelane ngngwa kemacütdi. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Langkegaimedung ngkiengsüt eh, Rampaube Jisu ringcuhdai kedi ha pwa zierang teigai, nah Tinggwang ngaugia kedi penui pelane reuga bam ciaudi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Penui kakga migede magah kecu bam dima, kedanemene pe tingdeu mede pe kidung kebamme cidungde zwadi delwe zwakelu gade ngaukelu rangkang teu gwanglu, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />delwe langkegaime ba gage kaibeu, nah cide hang gege kecu dage pa teu maikesia kieege mzi kebeune.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Cinzwa eh Joseph, Cyprus gade mnakelu Levime ge, langkegaimedung pecu Barnabas lie qukelabe (cide pekie Helungtaukemla nabe), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />pe luhpak ge bam kelade zwalwe rangkang teugwang langkegaime ba gage kaibeu.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananias penai Sapphira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Mipei ge pe zi Ananias, pe nau Sapphira de ngngwa mabam ge zwalu, <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />nah pa zwalukelu mi kesa pe ziemne kainzeudi (cide pe nau de cibam), nah pe mi kesa keugwanglwe langkegaime ba gage kaibeudi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Dede Peter rangdi, “Ananias, daitei Satan de peu n lung pui eh Kemci Rabe dade kenret delwe hangdeu zwakelu gade ngau kelude kesa n ziemne kainzeu no? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Cide zwamene kebamdau, cide nkatei ngu de meni, nah cide zwakelu caide, rangkang ngu de meni? Dainzwa nang aide n lung ga cetlu dino? Nang mina dage ma, dede Tinggwang dage nret dida.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Sam aidungde siu luge, Ananias kaumiedi nah tsaidi, nah cide siukelu leune ngngisütdi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Rehangmedung gwang pecu kezuilwe pwamie pecu kungdi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Nah bamdakkak kecum cai, pe nau daitei dibi ci mene lütlu. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Ge Peter pe dage, “Nnai hangdeu zwakelu gade ngau kelu aide deni?” de kegai dau, “Yeo, cide pemi da,” de eh pa keligai. <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Iciu eh Peter pe dage rangdi, “Dainzwa nnai Rampaube Rabe de kedak kera kesuizwalu dino? Ainie, n nahpei de kung kedime kikam ga sapbam dida, iciu eh penui ncude pwapet zie da.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Iciu eh pa zette pe pi ga kaumie tsaidi. Rehangmedung nlüt ge, pa tsai zeu kebam ngaulu, nah penui pecu pwapet pe nahpei tai gage kungdi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Cine ngqwa leune nah ma aidungde siukelu leune ngngisütdi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langkegaime mina kekieede teikengkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Langkegaimedung dade mimakecangh nah miswakegah batadung kekiee ge minadung kakga tei ladi. Penui pelane lungge tei eh Solomon Kigu ga ngkwalu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Dede migede penuide ngngwa ncüt kera kuu tadi; iciu liede, minadung penuide herüt peusüt kecu tei. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Iciu eh kenlumme mipui de nah mipei de kekiee ge Rampaube da gwangsi lu, <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />iciu eh penui keteei keneime dede puidi ki ga pwamie nah penuide zeu nah hesing pai kamlu delwe cikage peu zeulu, iciu eh Peter tetkah kegwangdau, pe mie lede penui kangge de sunggailu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Mina kekieege Jerusalem tai renamdung gade de gwang hekwalu, keteei keneime nah mcikemak rabe ne teikeherei kelame de ngngwa gwang eh, nah penui pelane de teingkei beu.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langkegaime de kemneu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Dede cingku kedibe nah pecu ngngwa kebam pelane cuhlu (cide Sadduceeme maame); nah penuide ngau penui riaksütdi <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />eh langkegaimedung de tuilu, delwe penuide hebaangki gage kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Dede tingmuidau Rampaube samgwame ge hebaangki kikamdung ngkeilwe penuide lungmpet beu eh ranggai, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mie delwe saplu eh kerecaki ga minadung dage aipau teilung samdung pelane ranglo.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Penui aide siu keludau, penui tingbaa reirang dauge kerecaki ga lütlu eh ledeu bamdi. Dede cingku kedibe nah pecu ngngwa kelame gwang, baudibe de nah Israel hangkiame pelane de qu hekwalu, delwe langkegaimedung de hebaangki gade ngngwa gwang kera langgai. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Dede kedimedung gwangge, penuide hebaangki ga ngaulu tadi, cine penui cailigwanglwe paubeu, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Anui hebaangki ngkui ntiprip pwa kebam nah kekwamedung kikam ga kesap ngaulu, dede cide ngkei kegaidau anui pe lung ga migede de ngau ma.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Cidau kerecaki kekwame reu kedibe nah cingku kedime sam aidungde siu luge, penuide daipai teidi dibi kecu cet pwa penui swagahdi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Cidau mige gwang eh penui dage ranggai, “Ainie, Nnui hebaangki gage kai kedimedung au kerecaki ga sap eh minadung de ledeu bamlie.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Cine kedibe pe kerecaki kekwame de ngngwalwe mie langkegaime penui kemei tei mene ngngwa caili gwanglu, kedanemene mina tangtsu le penuide samkera hing kedine. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Cidau penui langkegaime de ngngwa gwang luge, peu penuide baudi dwa saplu. Pecai cingkupei kedibe penuide keteu, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Anui nnuide aipau zi gade mide ledeu helo beu, dede nnui keledeusam rang Jerusalem puila dida, nah nnui mina aipaude jai anui reu gage keugwang beu neula dida.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Dede Peter nah langkegaimedung keligai, “Anui mina sam swade Tinggwang sam mzai maisia. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Anui paume Tinggwang nnui cross gage gwaktset kedibe Jisu de ketsai gade kwakcuh luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:22">Hez. 21:22</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 21:23">23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Israel de helungnreu kelu nah kemaugi kelu pwa kerane Tinggwang pecu teuncuh pwa peu Hegwang na nah Kelikelube tei eh pe ba zetle bam luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luk. 24:47</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Nah anui au ma aidungde zierangme da, nah cide nzwa Kemci Rabe deda, pa au Tinggwang pe sam mzaikelume de kepeu mapeu delie.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Cidau baudi peupeime aide siu luge, penui rata sütdi nah langkegaimedung de teitsetdi neudi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Dede baudi ga mige, Phariseeme ge pezi Gamaliel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gamaliel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu lungh kegwang tingdau Gamaliel au Sanhedrin ga pepeu keteume hangge nah Jewme keledeu kedi Hillel tsapei. </char></note> hezai keledeume ge, mi leune de pecu rütkela kauge, cuhsaplwe langkegaimedung de kaknage hegwale peu mpet dilo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Cidau pa penui dage rangdi, “Israelmedung, nnui mina aidungde de teu daitei laubi cet sünne lulo. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Kedanemene gwang kedi ting ga, Theudas pekatei pecule pwane mige lie cuhlu, nah mina haimdai ge pecu silu. Dede pecu teitsetdi, nah pe caisuime zangradi nah magede teilu tadi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Cipau peide cai, mina pum kepei tingdau Galileeme pei Judas cuhlu nah midungge de pe lambie ge teu gailu. Pecu de teitsetdi, nah pe caisuime pelane zangradi. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Cu aide Ih nnui dage rang gaila, mina aidungde dade nzia dilu nah penui dage magede teigai so, kedanemene magade aipau mariem de mede aipau tade mina dade gwang liecai, cide kau dizie. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Dede magade cide Tinggwang dade gwang liecai, nnui penuide teingkau gailak; mede nnui Tinggwang de ngngwa keregi bam lubui.” Cine penui pe sam luu kelu teilu. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Pecai penui langkegaimedung de qu nlütlwe penuide dap nah penuide Jisu zi gade marang helo aja kaigai eh peu penuide tetdi. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Iciu eh langkegaime baudibe dwa gade tet mpetdi, nah Jisu zi ziemne penuide hengam tei keherei lu kebuime tei kebeune penui suiyi ladi. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Nah tingba ramsangne, penui kerecaki gade nah ki leune ga Jisu au Khrista delie kecu samliakeyi de ledeu nah paurwa jüja ladi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Mina hena de kedet kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Cu aipau tingdau, ledeukelume maa kiee si reureu kebamdau, Greekme let kerang Jewme Hebrewme de ncam cuhdi, kedanemene penui hemipuidung de tingnai ramsang taktyei kemzi ga pie nsamlu ta kedine. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Cine kereiekenabau ledeukelumedung de qu hekwalwe rangdi, “Anui ketyeipokdung rengei kerane Tinggwang sam kerang de pütdi kera petau melie.” <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />“Ciziemne sinamedung, nnui kakgade mina mine kerütme, Rabe nah maci le kepui keteime hang hena de kedetlu, anui penuide aipau tade ziemne kedetlu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Dede anui kekie tei nah sambe teu zierang tei jüja lamui zie.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Penui samde hemaabe pelane penui suilu. Cine penui Stephen, kenlum nah Kemci Rabe le kepuime ge, nah Philip, nah Prochorus, nah Nicanor, nah Timon, nah Parmenas, nah Antioch namdi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Antioch namdi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Orontes reuki ga, Syria ga bam, nah nda cide de “Riblath” lie qula.</char></note> gade Jewme zai mzaikedi Nicolaus, aidungde de kedetlu. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Penui mina aidungde de langkegaime dwa ngngwa gwanglu, nah penui reu gage penui ba hwagai eh penui ziemne kekie teibeu.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Iciu eh Tinggwang sam zang si reureu petlu, nah Jerusalem ga ledeukelume kieesüt petdi, nah cingkumedung kekiee ge kenlumme teilu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stephen de tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Cu Stephen, ngaugia nah kengkieng le puipung eh, mimakecang nah miswakegah bata mina kakga tei bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Dede cika midungge Lungmpet-kelume lie qukela Synagogue peupeime nah Cyreneme, nah Alexandriame, nah Ciliciame penai Asia gade kegwang kangge de si eh penui Stephen de ngngwa kesamlimdi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Dede pa maci nah Kemci Rabe gade marang kedine penui pecu lia gailakdi. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Iciu eh penui mina kangge de hetauhenimlu eh peu ranggai, “Anui, Stephen, Moses de nah Tinggwang de rüt kemak samdung rangla eh siulie.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Penui minadung nah hangkiame nah hezai keledeume de helung teigai beu eh penui Stephen da gwang pecu tuilu delwe baudibe dwaga pecu ngngwa gwang. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Penui kenret zierangdung teugwang eh, ranggai, “Mina aipaude heni kemci aide nah hezaide rang kemsia samdung rang mtak ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:11">Jer. 26:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kedanemene pa Nazarethme Jisu heni aide teimsia dizie nah Moses dade anuida kegwang teilung zaisiedung de teintsam dizie de rangla eh anui siulie.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Baudi ga ntum kebamme pelane Stephen de pielingci gai, pe zu tinggimgwame zu nzwa nguadi kecune.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stephen sanhedrin dage makerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Cidau cingku kedibe keteudi, “Aidungde kesang deni?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Ge Stephen keligai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:2">“Mipeimedung, sinamedung, nah a peimedung, a sam kingneilo: Anui pei Abraham, Haran ga pa kelungh dwa, Mesopotamia ga kebamdau Tinggwang kendu pecu liagai; <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />nah pa pe dage ranggai, ‘N kibaume nah n deu pütdi delwe Ih ncu keulia kera deu dega mie lulo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 12:1</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Cidau Abraham Chaldeanme deu gade mpetlu delwe Haran ga lunghdi; cikade, pe pei tsai dige, Tinggwang pecu ngngwa gwang cu nnui lungh kebam deude gage kaibeu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 12:5</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Dede cika pa pecu mabam gede peuma, mi pideu tie nage de. Dede pa pe na gah liede, pecu nah pecai pe leuhme de hangdeu gum kera peu zielie sampet beu. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Dede Tinggwang pe dage ainzwa ranggai, n leuhme au cikemakme deuga sangme ge zie, nah cika kebamme penuide peu hebaangme ge teizie nah penuide mmi hai mdai ge peu reisüt zie. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Tinggwang rangdi, ‘Dede Ih penui kila teikela leuh de mmau zie, nah cipaucai n leuhme tetmpetlwe heni aide gade acu reca zie.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ge Tinggwang Abraham dage hegeukerum samkak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samkak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide mi hangna mede ciswa kekiee kakga samting kelu de rangbam.</char></note> zai de kaibeu, nah Abraham pe na Isaac lunghlu eh pecu lang hesetne benai pe geu rumlu; nah Isaac pe na Jacob lunghlu, nah Jacob dade anui paume kereiekena bau lunghlu. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Jacob namedung penui sinabe Joseph de penui riak eh pecu Egypt gage zwa gaidi. Dede Tinggwang pecu ngngwa la <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />nah pa keherei leune gade pecu kelibeu. Pa pecu Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh dwade maci peu nah peu pecu ngau pe suilu, nah peu pecu Egyptme reu nah pe kilungme pelane reu kedi teilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Cu Egypt nah Canaan pelane ga herakum kum gwang, nah cide ne keherei sütdi, nah anui paume ketyeipok ngaugai lakdi. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Dede Jacob Egypt ga taktyeipok bamlie kecu siu luge, pa anui paume de cika kemie raitube tei eh langgai. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Nah pe kenabe kemie ga, Joseph pe sinamedung depeu pecu cigai, nah Joseph kilungme de Pharaoh cilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Pecai pe sinamedung de langcaili gai eh Joseph pe pei Jacob de nah pe kibaume pelane de qugai, pelane ge riakhena-mengei. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Cine Jacob Egypt ga miedi, nah cikade pa nah anui paumedung tsaidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Penuide Shechem gage punggwanglu delwe Abraham ne Shechem ga Hamor name dade rangkang le luikelu herau gage kaizeu dida. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Tinggwang Abraham dage sampet kebeude tei kera ting nna gwang ge, minadung Egypt ga lungh kiee süt petlu, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Egypt deu reuga hegwang kedage Joseph de ci kemak ge cuh kemaktane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Tet. 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:8">8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Hegwang aide anui leuhme de cwa nah anui paumedung dade pe zaisia, penui kemei tei eh penui na ngienadung depeu lungmpet gai, iciu eh peu penuide tsaidi kerane. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Cipau tingdau Moses de mnalu; nah pa Tinggwang dwade hezu yisüt. Nah pecu pe pei ki gade keicum ge ngkwet cuhlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Tet. 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Nah pecu hegwale ge lungmpet kegaidau, Pharaoh napui pecu pe na teilu eh pekatei pe na nzwa pecu ngkwet cuhlu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Moses de Egyptme maci pelane pwa ledeu beu, nah pa pe samrang nah pe bata ga ngkiengsüt. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Dede pa mmi riakdai kedidau, pa pe sinamedung, Israelmedung de redau kera pe lungningdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11">Tet. 2:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Nah Israelme gede teukehei teikebam ngau luge, Moses pe lam sap nah pe kum pei eh Egyptme peide teitsetdi. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Kedanemene pa pe sinamedung Tinggwang pecu teu penuide teumpet beu zielie kecu cilu zieha de cet, dede penui aide ci luma. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Pecai benai pa Israelme kangge nggi kebam ga gwang, nah pa penaide nggnwa kezuyi lulo eh ranggai, ‘Nnui au caihereiswacing, daitei eh nnui hangge ge de tei rejam bamno?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Dede pe kidabe dage kemau tei kegaibe Moses de cwakgidi eh rangdi, ‘Caune ncu nai reu kedibe nah tutiakbe tei beuno? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Nang nziene Egyptme peide teitset kedinzwa, nang acu de teitsetdi neu lani?’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:13">Tet. 2:13</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 2:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Sam aide rang kegaidau Moses pakdi, nah pa Midianme deuga sangme ge teila di, nah cikade pa pe na hangna lunghlu. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Mmi riakdai ge gwang kedicai, tinggimgwame ge hetaideu ga Sinai Deutu tsinghum gega miheu gade peu pecu ngaugai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1">Tet. 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Moses mi cide ngau luge, pe swagahdi; nah pa cide pie zielie petge, pa Rampaube kwa siu:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Tet. 3:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:3">3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ih n paume Tinggwang, Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob Tinggwang.’ Cidau Moses mbeudi nah piegai kera ngngidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Ge Rampaube pe dage rangdi, ‘N pi gade n picum lwakdi, kedanemene nang sap kebam nide au kemci nilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Tet. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ih Egypt ga kebam a minadung keherei kebam ngau kesangda, nah Ih penui mra kegai kwade siu eh Ih penuide kelilu kerane hung bam; cine gwanglu, Ih ncu Egypt gage langgai zie.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Moses aide de nda penui mlai kedibe da, ‘Caune ncu anai reu kedibe nah tutiakbe tei beuno?’ de rang eh. Pa au Tinggwang ne tinggimgwabe tsinghum gade Moses de peu ngau kegaibe de ngha teu mina reu kedibe nah kelikelube tei zielie langkegaibe da. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Moses aide Egypt gade nah jaaidi kegie gade nah mmi riakdai ge hetaideu gade miswakegah nah mimakecang batadung tei eh penuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpetbeu. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Moses aipaude Israelme dage ranggai, ‘Tinggwang acu teucuh kebeu kenzwa nnui sinamedung kakgade caihakecibe gede teucuh beuzie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Hez. 18:15-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Pa au hetaideu ga hemaabe de ngngwa kelabe deda, nah Sinai Deutu gade tinggimgwabe pecu mpau kecube deda nah anui paume de ngngwa kelabe deda; pa kering sam anuide pwapeu kera ngau kelube deda. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Dede pa au anui paumedung pe sam pungrau kedibe deda, penui pecu mlaidi eh penui lung Egypt le ge nreucaili gaidai di. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Penui Aaron dage ranggai, ‘Anui lampui sauliabeu kera rabedung tei beulo. Kedanemene Moses, anuide Egypt gade ngngwa kempetbe de au daitei dibi anui ci meda.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Cine penui cidau ketumna ge teilu delwe mamie cide de ratak tei pwapeu, nah penui bata de ziemne penui suiyilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Tet. 32:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:6">6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Dede Tinggwang penui dade nreu delwe penuide pütdi, caihakecime laisiukwak gage rauteu kelanzwa, penuide peu tinggim ga hegidung de reca ladi kerane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Israelmedung, nnui mmi riakdai ge hetaideu ga keladau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">makaunedung daptsetlwe acu reca nah ratak teibeu ni?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nnui rabe Molech<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Molech: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Hebrewme let gade, pekie cai “Hegwang.” Molech au Ammonme reca kela rabe. </char></note> reca paiki de pwa luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">nah nnui rabe Rephan hegi de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">nah nnui reca kera tei kelu miedung de;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">cine Ih nnuide Babylon gwale ge langgi dizie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25">Amo. 5:25</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 5:26">26</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Anui paumedung hetaideu ga keladau zierang paiki de penui dala. Cide Tinggwang Moses de rang kebeu nzwa, pa kengau rehi de nzwa teilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Reca paiki de ngau keludau, anui paume Joshua kangga de, Tinggwang ne gwa mpetkedi heleuhdung deu penui gumkelu ga cide punggwanglu. Cide David tingdau kecang cika bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Pa Tinggwang miakngau gade petaube teilu, nah pa Jacob Tinggwang ziemne bam kera heni ge tei kera kie. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Dede Solomon ne Tinggwang ziemne ki de teilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Dede Hutube heba le ketei ki ga lungh lama, caihakecibe kerang nzwa,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Tinggim au a hegwangbam, nah kideu au a pidau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Nang a ziemne ki daikenzwa ge teilu buino? de eh Rampaube rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">mede Ih mtak kera ni daipai no?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 66:1-2</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Aidungde pelane a ba ne teigai de meni?’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Nnui lung ketakmedung, nah nnui lung nah nnui kwen hegeurum kemakmedung, nnui Kemci Rabe de renia mui lala. Nnui paume reniakela nzwa nnuide reniala. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nnui paumedung caihakecime caube de tei keherei meno? Penui Kesamsangbe gwangkera mrairang kegaimedung de teitset dida, cu nnui au cipaude de kecwabe nah teitset kedimedung dida,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Hel. 36:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />nnui Moses zaidung tinggimgwame dade ngaulu dede cide mzai kemakmedung.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stephen de tangtsu kesam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ma aidungde siu keludau, baudi peupeime penui rata sütdi, nah penui Stephen de penui rata eh geigimdi. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Dede pa, Kemci Rabe puipung eh tinggim ngangcu piegai nah Tinggwang kendu de ngau; nah pa Jisu Tinggwang ba zetle sapbam eh ngau. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Stephen rangdi, “Ainie, Ih tinggimdung ngkei kegai, nah Mina Nabe Tinggwang ba zetle sap kebam ngau.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Cidau baudi peupeime penui kwen ngketlwe sahbak eh mrung eh pelane de peda pak gwang. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Pecai pecu namdi gwale teukerei mpetlwe penui pecu tangtsu le sam. Zierangmedung penui pai gaulwe rehangme ge Saul lie kecu pi gage kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Penui Stephen de tangtsu le sam kebamdau, pa kiegai, “Rampaube Jisu, a rabe de ngngwa lulo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Lei. 31:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Nah pa kwaktung mie sahbak gai, “Rampaubo, aipau maude peu penui reuga gwangdi helo.” Pa aide ranggai eh tsaidi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s">Ngqwabe keherei nah zangra kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Saul Stephen de teitsetdi kerade kesuizwalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Cipaunai Jerusalem ga kebam ngqwa de teikehereisüt cuhdi; nah langkegaimedung gwale, kenlumme pelane Judea nah Samaria cuikui ga zangrala kapdi. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Kenlummedung Stephen de hei eh hap sütgai eh kungdi. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Dede Saul ngqwabe de teimsia sütdi, kige gade kige ga mie, mipeidung nah mipuidung de teukerei mpet delwe penuide hebaangki gage kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philip Samaria ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Cu zangra kedi kenlummedung kehei leune ga mie samliakeyi de teu zierang tei pwaladi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Philip<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Philip: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa cingkume hena kakgade hangge, Bat. 6:5. Pecu pecai, “Evangelist,” de qudi. </char></note> Samaria namdi ga nghung cika penui dage Khrista ha zierang tei. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Cu penui pe sam siu nah pa miswakegah bata tei kegaidung ngau luge, hemaabe ngngwa ket tei eh Philip kerang samdung kingnei sünne lu. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Kedanemene mina kekieege dade mcikemak rabedung sahbak gai eh mpetdi; nah kemnoime nah pisiame mina kekiee de tei ngkeilu. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Cine namdi cika suiyi le puidi.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simon kerekabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Dede namdi cika mige pe zi Simon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa mide kehemeu ta keteime ge, cine pezi Simon “Magus” pekie “Kehemeu” de qu la.</char></note> lie kecuge bamla, pa kehemeu ta tei nah pa pekatei pecu kenlangme gelie eh Samariame de kemeu teugwang. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Samariame pelane, ceutube gade gwang ditu kecang pe kwa kingnei sünne eh ranggai, “Aipau peide au Tinggwang kengkieng lie kela Kedi deda.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Penui pe sam kingneila, kedanemene pe kehemeu tale pwane pa peting ketie ge penuide kemeu teu kegwangne. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Dede penui Philip Tinggwang hegwangram ha nah Jisu Khrista zi samliakeyi teu zierang teikegai nlum luge, penui mipei de nah mipui de duipum teilu. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simon de nlumlu, nah pa duipum tei kelucai Philip taiga ladi. Pa mimakecang nah miswakegah bata tei kegai ngau luge, pe swagahdi.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Cu Jerusalem ga kebam langkegaimedung Samariame Tinggwang sam luu kelu ha siu luge, penui Peter penai John de penui dage langgai. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Penai nghung luge peu penuide Kemci Rabe ngaulu kerane penui ziemne kekie teibeu. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Kedanemene Kemci Rabe penui hangge dade gwang mereu, dede penui Rampaube Jisu zi gade duipum teikelu rünne reu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Cidau Peter penai John penai ba hwapwa penui reu gage kaigai, nah penui Kemci Rabe ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Cu Simon langkegaime penui ba hwagai ge Rabe ngaukelu ngau luge, pa penaide rangkang pwapeu. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Pa rangdi, “Acude kengkieng aide peulo, iciude Ih keheibe dage a ba hwa gaide Kemci Rabe ngaulu kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Dede Peter pe dage keligai, “Ngu rangkanggeu depeu ncu ngngwa kap dilu, kedanemene nang Tinggwang mapeu rangkang teu luilu kera cet kelane. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Nang aipau dega n qwa kette gah, kedanemene nlung au Tinggwang dwa gade petaula melu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:37">Lei. 78:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ciziemne nang n kesiadung gade nreulu delwe Rampaube dade kielu, ciude pa nlungning kesia gade n mau gibeu de cilaklu. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kedanemene nang n riaksiasüt nah kemau baang tei kebam Ih ngau.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Cidau Simon keligai, “A ziemne Rampaube dade kielo, iciu eh nang kerang samdung depeu a da magede gwang melu kerane.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Penai zierang tei nah Rampaube sam rang kegai cai, Peter penai John Samariame renamdung kekiee ge ga samliakeyi de zierang tei eh Jerusalem ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philip penai Ethopiame ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Tingnai ge Rampaube tinggimgwame ge Philip dage ranggai, “Cuhlu delwe tingpi lebie Jerusalem gade Gaza ga kemie lampui ga miecu.” (Lampui aide hangdeu ketsai gega bam.) <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Cine pa cuhlu delwe tetdi. Cidau Ethopiame pei ge, Eunuch<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eunuch: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aika eunuch de kecu de “Kengkim kedime, mede deuceu pie kerengeime” de rangbam. </char></note> ge Ethopiame hegwangpui Candace kengkieng kangga ngkiengsüt kecu ge la. Pa pe mabam pelane pie rengeila. Pa reca kerane Jerusalem ga mie. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Pa pe bagi reuga ntum eh pe deudi ga cailigwang la, nah caihakecibe Isaiah laisiu peila. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ge Kemci Rabe Philip dage rangdi, “Cika mie delwe bagi taiga lalu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Cine Philip peda pakmie, nah pa Isaiah caihakecisam peibam eh siulwe keteu, “Nang pei kebam de nang ci kesang bam deni?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Pa keligai, “Dainzwa Ih cide ci lulai, mige acu sauliabeu mecai?” Cine pa Philip de pe taiga nghang bagi ga bam kera qu. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Cu Ethopiame pei kebam kesanglaisiu samria de ainzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Pecu meurün gede daptset zielie ngngwa kegwang nzwa teuswa gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">nah meurünna ge pemai kebitbe dwade mlei la kemak nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">cine pa pe mui ngkei ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 53:7-8</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Hengam gade pe kemzui tutiak keutetdi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Caune pe leuhmedung ha rangkap lulai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kedanemene pe teilung kideu gade keuteu kedine.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Cine eunuch Philip de keteudi, “Ih n dade kiela, caihakecibe cau ha rang bamno, pekatei pe ha mi, mi kedage ha rang lano?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Cine Philip pemui ngkeilwe kesanglaisiu gade ndeu eh pa pe dage Jisu samliakeyi ha zierang teigai. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Iciu eh penai lampui ga tet keladau, penai gwang dui daulu, ge eunuch rangdi, “Pielo, aika dui bamda. Acu duipum ketei kekaam dai bam no?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga pedum 37 de sila. </char></note>[Philip rangdi, “Nang nlung pelane teu nlum lucai, nang duipum tei lubui.” Ethopiame pei keligai, “Jisu Khrista au Tinggwang Na lie kecu Ih nlum.”] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Cine Ethopiame pei bagi mtak lulo aja kaigai. Pecai penai hangna na, Philip nah eunuch dui ga nghunglu delwe Philip pecu duipum teibeu. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Penai dui gade mpet luge, Rampaube Rabe Philip de ngngwa tetdi, nah eunuch pecu madaude ngausi tadi, dede pa pe suiyi eh pe lampui ga tet gwangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:12">1 Heg. 18:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Dede Philip Azotus namdi gade peu mide pecu ngaugai nah pa Caesarea namdi ga gwang canglu kemaktane cipau cuikui namdidung pelane ga samliakeyi zierang teigwang.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Saul helungkenreu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Dede Saul cidaude Rampaube caisuimedung de keheu nah teitset dizie lie eh cingku kedibe da mie <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nah pe dade Damascus namdi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Damascus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Syria namdi ga, Jerusalem tingpeule-kepetle bie mile 120, nah Antioch tingpile-kepetle bie mile 190 kenzwa gega bam.</char></note> ga kebam synagoguedung gage laisiudung raugailo kiedi, iciu eh pa magade mige Rampaube saulia kebeu lampui ga mzui kelamede ngau lucai, mipei de nah mipui de pa penuide Jerusalem ga tuiteu gwanglu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Pa mbeuh keladau, Damascus namdi tai nna kegwang ge, zette tinggim gade kebaa ge pecu gi mbaa twagwalu; <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />nah pa hangdeu ga kaumiedi nah makwa ge pe dage rang eh siu, “Saul, Saul, daitei nang acu teikeherei lano?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saul keteugai, “Nang cauno, Rampaubo?” Ge Rampaube rangdi, “Ih Jisu, nang tei keherei kelabe; <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />dede cuhlwe namdibe ga lütlu, iciude nang tei maikesiabe ncu ranglia beuzie.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Dede Saul de ngngwa mbeuh kelamedung penui swagahdi, penui makwa de siu dede migede de ngau ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Cidau Saul hangdeu gade cuhlu, dede pe miak mrak gaige, pa magede ngaulu tadi; cine penui pe ba teulwe pecu Damascus ga ngngwa gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Pa langcumne ma ngaulu tadi, nah pa matyei mede sak ma.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Cidau Damascus ga ledeukelume pezi Ananias lie kecu ge bam. Rampaube marengei gade pe dage, “Ananias!” de qugai, cine pa keligai, “Ainie, Ih aika bam, Rampaubo.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ge Rampaube pe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu, delwe lampui Kemzui lie qukelade ga miecu, delwe Tarsusme mige pezi Saul, ha Judas ki gade keteu lulo, kedanemene ainie, pa kekie tei bamlu. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Kedanemene pa marengei gade mipei ge pezi Ananias lie kecu ge gwang delwe pe ba pe reu gage hwa kegai ngau, iciu eh pa ma ngau dailu kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Dede Ananias sam keligai, “Rampaubo, pa Jerusalem ga daikenzwage de n kemcimedung de teikehereibi kecu mina kekieege dade Ih aipau pei de ha siuda. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Pa cingku kedimedung dade aika n zi qu kelame leune de tuilu kera kengkieng ngau luda.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Dede Rampaube pe dage rangdi, “Miecu, kedanemene mina aipaude a gwa tei kerane kedet kelume ge lu, pa Gentileme, hegwangme nah Israelmedung dwade a zi rang liazie; <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />pa a zi ziemne daikenzwa gede rei maisiabi Ih pecu keulia zie.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Cine Ananias mie delwe kilung ga lütlu. Pa pe reu gage pe ba hwagai eh ranggai, “Sinabe Saul, Rampaube Jisu, nang gwang keladau ncu peu pecu lampuiki gade ngau kegaibe dene acu langgai lei, iciu eh nang mangau dailu nah Kemci Rabe le kepui teilu kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ge zette malip kenzwadung ge Saul miak gade cakmiedi, nah pa mangau dailu. Pa cuhlu eh duipum teilu; <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />nah pa matyeilu eh ngkienglu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saul Damascus nah Jerusalem ga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Pecai pa zie kiee kemakge Damascus ga kenlummedung de ngngwa bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Nah pa zette synagoguedung gade Jisu au Tinggwang Nabe lie kecu zierang tei cuhdi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Pe kwa siukelu leune penui swagahdi eh keteu, “Mina aipaude Jerusalem ga hezi aide de kenlummedung de teikeherei kecube de meni? Pa aika aipau kiede ziemne gwang, iciu eh pa penuide tuilu delwe cingku kedimedung da ngngwa gwanglu kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Dede Saul ngkieng reureu di, nah Jisu Khristabe delie ranglia mci kegaine Damascus ga kelungh Jewme pe sam keligai lakdi.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Dede zie kekieege gwang kedicai, Jewme pecu teitset kera ngngwalwe heciem riemdi. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Dede Saul penui ciemde cilu. Kedanemene penui pecu teitset kerane tingmui tingba kiriedung kwa bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Dede pe caisuimedung pecu tingmui gage ngngwalu delwe pecu marak gage kailwe kirie reu gade teu henah ngkeibeudi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Pa Jerusalem ga gwang luge, Saul ledeukelume de ngngwa ket teilu kera tei, dede penui peciakne pecu hingdi, pa kenlumme ge lie kecu nlum kemakne. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Dede Barnabas pecu ngngwalu eh langkegaimedung da ngngwa gwang delwe Saul dainzwa lampui gade Rampaube de ngau nah Rampaube pecu mpaubi, nah Saul dainzwa kuu delwe Damascus gade Jisu zi teu ledeu bi kecu pa penuide ranglia. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Cine pa penuide ngngwa bamdi nah Jerusalem pelane ga mie Rampaube zi gade kuusüt eh mide ledeu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Pa Greekme let rangkela Jewme de de ngngwa marang reniadi; dede penui pecu teitsetdi kera teiladi. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Kenlumme aide ci luge, penui pecu Caesarea namdi ga ngngwa nghung delwe pecu Tarsus namdi gage lang gaidi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Cine Judea nah Galilee nah Samaria ga kebam ngqwabe pelane ga kezuyi bamlu nah ngkieng si reureu lu; nah, Rampaube mie kehing gade lungh cu nah Kemci Rabe ngha gade ngqwa peupeime kieesi petlu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aeneas penai Dorcas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Cidau Peter cuikui pelane ga mie, pa Lydda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lydda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namceu aide Jerusalem gade Caesarea Philippi lampui de ga bam. </char></note> ga lungh kebam kemcimedung dade hung. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Cika pa mige pe zi Aeneas lie kela gede redaulu, pa mmi heset ge zeu ga zeu ciangbam, kedanemene pa mnoi kecune. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Cine Peter pe dage ranggai, “Aeneas, Jisu Khrista ncu teihemi beula. Cuhlu delwe n zeu lamluilu,” ge pa zette cuhlu. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Ge Lydda nah Sharon nam ga kelunghme pelane minabe de ngau eh penui Rampaube da nreu gwanglu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Cidau Joppa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Joppa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide liemtaubam namceu ge, Mediterranean ga bam, Caesarea tingpilebie mile 30, nah Jerusalem tingpeu-kenlütle bie mile 45 kenzwa gega. </char></note> ga kenlum puige pezi Tabitha lie bamla, cide kedet pwa “Dorcas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dorcas </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: pe zi Greekme let gade Dorcas nah Aramic gade Tabitha.</char></note>” dela. Aipau bata keyidung tei nah kegahme dage ngaugia tadung teigwang. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Cipau tingdau, pa mra bam eh tsaidi. Penui pecu huimci lu eh nreube kibung gage kailu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lydda Joppa tai kemna ga kebamne, kenlummedung Peter cika bamlie kecu siu luge, penui mina hangna gede pe dage langgai eh kiegai, “Anuida ridi mene gwanglo.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Cine Peter cuhlwe penaide ngngwa gwangdi. Pa gwangcang luge, penui pecu kibung nreube ga ngngwa hanglu, nah hemipuidung pe taiga sap eh Dorcas penuida kebamdau tei kebeu ncwadung nah painidung pecu pwalia eh hap bam. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ge Peter penui pelane depeu hegwale mpetdieh koktunglwe pa kiegai. Pecai, hepaaube lambie nreugwanglwe pa ranggai, “Tabitha, cuhlu.” Ge pa pe miak mraklu nah Peter de ngaulu eh cuh ntumlu. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Pecai Peter pecu pe ba hetwabeu delwe teu ncuhlu; nah pa kemcimedung nah hemipuidung de qulwe pa ring kebamde penui depeu ngaugai. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Aipau hade Joppa namdi pelane ga ci gwangdi, nah mina kekieege Rampaube de nlumlu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Cidau Peter Joppa ga mige teigeuta keteime ge pezi Simon lie qukela gede zie kekieege ngngwa bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Cornelius Peter de kequ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Caesarea namdi ga mige pezi Cornelius,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cornelius: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Latinme zi, cine aipau pei de Romeme ge lie kecu liagai. </char></note> Italyme Reugwamaa lie qukela haireu kedibe ge bamla. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Pa au renet kemcokme ge nah pe kilungme pelane de ngngwa Tinggwang de recala; pa kegahme de rangkang kekiee peu bamla nah pa Tinggwang dade kiebam muila. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Tingnaige tingna bamcum dau, pa merengei kengau gade mcigi eh Tinggwang gwame ge peda gwang eh, “Cornelius!” debeu. <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Dede Cornelius ngngidi eh tinggimgwabe de pieling gai eh ranggai, “Daipai no, Kedibo?” Ge tinggimgwabe pe dage rangdi, “N kekie nah kegahme de kepeu n mapeudung reca Tinggwang dwaga hang cangbam dida. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Cine minadung gede Joppa gage langgai eh Simon pecu le Peter lie qu kelabe de ngngwa gwang lulo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Pa au Simon, teigeuta tei kelabe, peki zaidi kung ga kebambe de ngngwabam.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Tinggimgwabe pe dage makerangbe de tet dige, Cornelius pe ki ga kebam kilame hangna nah pe gwa keteime kakgade reugwa kenlumme gede qulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Pa penui dage daipai teidi bi kecu pelane ranglia nah Cornelius penuide Joppa gage lang gaidi.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter makengau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Pecai benai penui mbeuh eh namdibe ga nna gwang keladau, Peter tingna dauge kiniem reuga kekie tei kera hangdi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ge pa mzeudi nah mage tyeigai neudi, dede minadung ketyeipok mtei kebamdau, pa marengei ge ngau, <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />nah pa tingkam ngkei kegai nah maniage hepai disüt kecu kenzwage, petu mdaide ne kideu gage teu nghung kela ngau. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Cika makaune pideu-mdai leune nah kideu reu ga bwa kela kaudung, nah tingkam ruinedung leune la. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Cidau makwa ge peda ranggai: “Cuhlu, Peter, teitset lwe tyeilu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Dede Peter rangdi, “Lak, Rampaubo; Ih madaude keherabe nah mci kemakbe tyeila melu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herakedibe nah mci kemakbe tyeila melu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hezai gade, makaune kesadung nah mania kedadung Jewme renet kaam dila. Cidung de mci melie eh cetla kecune. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Dede pe kenabe makwa de peda gwangdai: “Tinggwang ne teimci kedibe hera lie diso.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Cu aide piacum iciudi, pecai mania de tingkam ga zette teunghang daidi.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Cu Peter marengei pa kengaude pekie daibi kecu cetdau gailak eh kebamdau, ainie, mina Cornelius ne langkegaimedung penui Simon ki dailam bi kecu keteulwe penui kirie dwaga sapbam. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Pecai penui qulwe Simon, Peter lie kelabe de cika bam mi mebi kecu keteu. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Peter marengei de daibi kecu cet bamreu kecudau, Kemci Rabe pe dade rangdi, “Ainie, minadung ncu peeila lie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">mina hangna ncu peila</char> mede <char style="fqa">mina kangge ncu peila, de eh bam</char>. </note> <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Cine cuhlu delwe nghung lwe penuide nzang gwanglu. Lunghau diso, kedanemene Ih ne penuide langgai dilu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Cine Peter minadung da nghunglwe rangdi, “Ainie, nnui peei kelabe de Ih da. Daiziemne nnui gwang lano?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Penui keligai, “Cornelius, haireu kedibe, masang nah Tinggwang mie hing kelame ge, Jewme pelane pecu rüt kela kauge, kemci tinggimgwame ge aipau kiga gwang ncu qulo rang beulie, iciu eh pa n dade samlia siulu kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Cine Peter penuide peda bam lulo qulu nlütlu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Peter Cornelius ki ga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Delwe pecai benai pa cuhlu delwe penuide ngngwa miedi, nah Joppa gade kenlummedung gede pecu nzang miedi. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Pecai benai penui Caesarea ga gwanglu. Cornelius pe kibaume nah pe zangme de qu hekwalwe penuide kwabam. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Peter lütge, Cornelius pecu daulwe pe pi ga keumie pecu reca. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Dede Peter pecu teu cuhlu eh, ranggai, “Sap lulo, Ih de mina lie.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Peter pecu ngngwa mpau jüja kilung ga lütge, mina kekiee ngngwa ngkwa kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Jewme ge heleuh kedame de ngngwa kekangbau mede mige de mie redau kecu hezai kemak nnui ci bam. Dede Ih migede de keherabe lie mede mcikemakbe lie qu kelak Tinggwang acu keulia dida. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ciziemne nnui acu lang kegaidau, Ih mlaidi mene gwang luda. Cine Ih nnui dade keteula, daiziemne acu qu gaino?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Cidau Cornelius keligai, “Lang mdaine dwa aipau tingsiak ga, Ih a ki ga bamcum tingdau kekie teibam ge; ainie, mipei ge pai rebaaha kecu bahlwe a dwa ga saplu. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Pa rangdi, ‘Cornelius n kekie nah kegahme de kepeu n mapeudung reca Tinggwang dwaga hang cangbam dida. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Cine, Joppa gage mina kangge de langgai lo, delwe Simon Peter lie qu kelabe de qulo. Pa zaidi kung ga Simon, teigeuta keteibe kiga bamlie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga: </char><char style="fqa">Pa kegwang dau, pa ncu mpau zie, de kecu de kaisi. </char> </note> <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Cine Ih zette midungge de n dage langgai. Nang nzaiyi eh gwang luda. Cu cine, Rampaube ncu rang lulo kebeu sam leune kiengnei zielie, anui pelane aika Tinggwang dwaga gwang bamda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Rampaube ne ranglulo, </char><char style="fqa">de mene, </char> kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, <char style="fqa">Tinggwang ne ranglulo, de kecude bam.</char> </note> <verse eid="ACT 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ge Peter marang cudi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:34">“Tinggwang heneuherüt teila kemak kesang lie kecu Ih ci luda. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Dede heleuh pelane ga keheibe de pe mie hing nah petaube tei kelame au pa luulu kebuime. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Pa Israelme dage samlia kai kegaide, Jisu Khrista, pelane reu Rampaube dade kezuyi samliakeyi teu ledeu kegwangde nnui cibam, <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />John duipum ketei zierang de tei kedicai, Galilee deuceu gade pe bangdwa tei eh Judea deu pelane ga sam rangrwa kegwang de nnui cibam; <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Nnui Nazarethme Jisu ha, dainzwa Tinggwang pecu Kemci Rabe nah kengkieng le keniaklu bi kecu cibam. Pa makeyi tei gwang nah herakesiabe ne ngngwakela pelane de teingkei beu, kedanemene Tinggwang pecu ngngwa kelane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa. 61:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Anui Jewme deudi ga nah Jerusalem ga Jisu bata teikegai leune zierangmedung da. Penui pecu pwa cross gage gwak eh teitsetdi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:22">Hez. 21:22</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 21:23">23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />dede Tinggwang langcum ne benai pecu kwak cuhlu delwe peu pecu ngaugai, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />mileune dage ma, dede Tinggwang ne kedet teukela zierangme dage, anui pa ketsai gade ringcuh kelucai pecu ngngwa matyei nah masak kecume dage. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Pa anuide mina dage rang ledeu lo nah Tinggwang keringme nah ketsaimedung tutiakbe tei kera kedet kelube pa delie zierang teilu lo aja kaibeu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Caihakecimedung pelane pe zierang teigwang, iciu eh mileune pecu nlum kelume pe zi gade penui maudung gi kelu ngaulu kerane.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Peter cidungde rang kebamdau, pe sam kingnei kebamme pelane reu Kemci Rabe gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Peter de ngngwa kegwang kenlumme hegeurum kelame pelane penui ma canghdi, kedanemene Kemci Rabe mapeu Gentileme reu gage de ruigai kebeune. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kedanemene penui aipau Gentilemedung helet kedadung gade marang eh Tinggwang de twa kebam siu kelune. Ge Peter keligai, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Anui nzwa mina aidungde de Kemci Rabe ngau luda, mi keheibe de mina aidungde de peu duipum teidi melu kerane kaam lubui ni?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Cine pa penuide Jisu Khrista zi gade duipum tei lulo aja kaibeu. Pecai penui pecu tingbazie kiee kemak ge penuide ngngwa bamlo kiedi.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Peter pe bata ha rangmcikegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Judea ga kebam langkegaime nah kenlumme kedamedung Gentileme de Tinggwang sam luulu delie kecu siulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Peter Jerusalem ga caili nghang luge, hegeurumla kela maabe pecu ngngwa kesamlimdi; <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />penui rangdi, “Nang hegeurum la kemakme de nzang nah penuide ngngwa matyei!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Dede Peter macidungde pelane penui dage ranglia siakte cu eh pa ranggai, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ih Joppa namdi gade kekie teibam ge, Ih marengei gade maniage, mapai disüt kecu kenzwa ge petu mdai ne keulwe tinggim gade hezu hung kela ngau. Nah cide ada nghung . <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ih cide pie siakte gai nah ncetgai. Ih kideu ga pideu-mdai kaune nah renaam kaune nah bwa kela kaaunedung nah tingkam ga ruinedung de ngau. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Pecai Ih makwa ge a dage rang eh siu, ‘Cuhlu, Peter teitsetlwe tyeilu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Dede Ih rangdi, ‘Lak, Rampaubo, kedanemene keherabe mede mcikemakbe magede a mui gage kaila melu.’” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Dede makwa de tinggim gade pia pe kenabe keligai, “Tinggwang teimci kedibe hera lie diso.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Cu aide piacum teidi, nah pecai ma pelane tinggim gage teu nghang daidi. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ainie, cipau ting siakdau mina hangcum anui kebam ki dwaga gwanglu, penuide Caesarea gade a dage langgai. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Kemci Rabe acu lunghau mene penuide ngngwa mielo rangbeu. Siname hangherok aidungde acu nzang mie, anui minabe ki gage lütlu. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Pecai pa dainzwa tinggimgwabe pe kiga sap eh ngaubi anui dage ranglia, ainzwa rang eh, “Joppa ga mina de langgai eh Simon, Peter lie qu kelabe de ngngwa gwang lulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Pa n cu nah n kilungme de kelilu kera sam nnui dage rang liazie.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Dede Ih penui dage ma ranglia cuge, Kemci Rabe nda anuida kegwang nzwa penuida gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ge Ih Rampaube kerang samde nsunglu, pa ranggai, “John dui teu duipum tei, dede nnuide Kemci Rabe gade duipum teilu zie.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />“Anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista de nlum keludau Tinggwang anuide mtamapeu kepeude penuide peu liecai, Tinggwang de ngngwa renia kera cau no?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Penui aidungde siu luge penui mage de rang keli tadi, dede penui Tinggwang de twa eh ranggai, “Iciu cai Tinggwang Gentilemede de ringlu kera helungkenreu peuda.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antioch ga ngqwabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Stephen de teikeherei kecu de ziemne tet zangra kedimedung kemdei Phoenicia deuceu, Cyprus duigwadeu nah Antioch namdi ga kecang gwang eh sambe pwa Jewme rünne dage ranglia. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Dede penui midungge Cyprus nah Cyrene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cyrene: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide au deuceu ge, nah Africa ga Libya namdi ge. </char></note> gade kegwangme Antioch ga gwang delwe Greekmede de Rampaube Jisu ha samliakeyi de pau liagai. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Rampaube kengkieng de penuide nzang la, nah mina kekiee ge nlumlu eh Rampaube da nreu gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Jerusalem ga ngqwabe da cipau hade gwang cangluge, penui Barnabas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Barnabas: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa Cyprus reketme ge, nah Antioch namdi de ci mmi süt bam lubui.</char></note> de Antioch namdi gage langgaidi. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Pa gwang Tinggwang ngaugiabe ngau keludau, pa pesui yidi, nah pa penui pelane de penui mlung pelane teu Rampaube dade masang eh bam lulo penuide kecung gai. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Kedanemene pa au mina keyi nah Kemci Rabe nah kenlumle kepui kauge kecune, nah mina kekiee gede Rampaube da ngngwa gwang silu. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ipaucai Barnabas Saul de peei zielie Tarsus ga miedi. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Pa pecu ngau luge pecu ngngwa Antioch ga gwangdi. Iciu eh penai mmi ge ngqwame de ngngwa ngkwa, nah mina kekiee gede ledeu. Cidau Antioch gade kenlumme de pwa Khristianme lie qu raitu lu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Aipau tingdau caihakecimedung ge Jerusalem gade Antioch ga nghunglu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Penui kakgade hangge pe zi Agabus, saplu delwe Rabe gade herakum kedi ge kideu reu pelane ga gwang zielie ranggai. Aide Claudius tingdau gwang. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Cine, ledeukelumedung keheibede penui teilu kebui kieege gade Judea ga kelunghme dage kengha langgai zielie riemlu. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Cine penui cinzwa eh rangkang hekwalu delwe Barnabas penai Saul ba gage langpwa Jerusalem namdi ngqwa ga hangkiame dage kaibeu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Peter hebaangki gade mpetkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Cipau tingdau hegwangpei Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hegwangpei Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Herod Agrippa, pa Herod Kedibe tsapei. </char></note> ngqwa ga peupei mi kangge de teikeherei cuhdi. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Pa, John caihereibe, James de kiengtie le bitsetdi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Jewmedung aide penui suikedi pa ngau luge, pa Peter de de tuikera tei. Cu cide Tsehikaikemak Tangku Ngyi tingdau. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Pecu tuikelucai, pa pecu hebaangki gage kaidi, delwe reugwame hang mdai kecu maa mdai depeu pecu kwa kera kaibeudi; pa Kahkegwang Ngyi de cang kedicai pecu minadung dwa ngngwa gwang pe tutiak kera cet bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Cine, Peter de hebaangki gage kaidi, dede ngqwame pe ziemne Tinggwang dade kie sünne gai. <verse eid="ACT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Herod pe tutiak kera teumpet keradwa beziu, Peter de geukap kena le kanglwe reugwame hangna kakga zipbam, nah kekwame kimuiki dwaga hebaangki kwabam. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ainie, Rampaube samgwame ge zette eh peda gwang, nah hebaangki bung ga kebaage baa hadi. Pa Peter mbie gage deugai nah pecu ngkialwe rangdi, “Cuh zettelu,” ge pe ba kena geukap cak mieddi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Pecai tinggimgwabe pe dage rangdi, “N paini kailu nah n picum punglu.” Cine Peter cinzwalu. Tinggimgwabe pe dage rangdi, “N pai bahlwe a caisuilu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Cine Peter tinggimgwabe caisuilwe mpetlu. Dede pa tinggimgwabe tei kegaide kesanglie kecu cima. Kedanemene pa marengei ge ngau aulie cet kedine. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Pecai penai reketme keraibe nah kenabe de kahmpet namdi ga kenlüt hegeu rieki ga gwanglu; ge penai ziemne cide pekatei ngkeidi, pecai penai hegwale mpetlwe puidiki ge ga nghung, ge zette tinggimgwabe pecu pütdi. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Peter pe dage daipai tei gaibi kecu ci luge, pa pekatei pecu rangdi, “Ih cu Rampaube pe tinggimgwabe de langgai eh acu Herod ba gade nah Jewme hengin kebam pelane gade kelikebeu ci luda.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Pa aide ci luge, John, Mark liede de qukelabe pui Mary ki ga miedi, cika mina kekiee ge ngkwa nah kekie teibam. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Pa kirie kikam ketunggai kecudau, kilapui ge pe zi Rhoda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rhoda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Greekme zi, pekie rose pa ge.</char></note> lie kecu gene pet ngkei beu. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Pa Peter kwa kecu ciluge, pe suiyi gade kikam ngkei mene kibung ga paknlüt Peter kikam ga sap bamlie eh paubeu. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Cine penui pe dage rangdi, “Nang mie auda.” Dede pa cide kesanglie di. Ge penui rangdi, “Cide au pe tinggimgwabe.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Dede Peter ketung bamdi nah penui kikam ngkei gaige, penui pecu ngaulwe penui macangdi. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Ge Peter pe ba le penuide maciem teigai eh matu helo gai, nah Rampaube dainzwa hebaangki gade pecu lungmpet beubi kecu ranglia. Pa rangdi, “Aide James nah sinamedung dage ranglia lo.” Cipaucai pa tetdi nah heni keda ga miedi. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ting baapet ge, reugwamedung kakga Peter de daipai teidi bi kecu kehebwak ge bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herod pecu peei eh pecu ngauluta dige, pa hebaangki kekwamedung de keteu delwe penuide teitsetdi kera aja kai beudi. Pecai pa Judea gade Caesarea namdi ga nghung bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herod tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Cu Herod Tyreme nah Sidonme de pe rata sütdi. Cine penui maa ge tei eh pecu redaukera mie. Penui hegwangpei de ngha kebambe Blastus de penuide nghalo kiegai. Pecai penui kezuyi bamlu kera kiegai, kedanemene penui deudi hegwangpei deudi gade ketyeipok ngau bam kelane. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Cine peting rietpwa kenzeu benai, Herod pe hegwang paini kailu, pe hegwangbam ga bamlu delwe penui dage marang gai. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Dede minadung sah gai, “Aide rabe sam, mina sam ma!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Zette Rampaube samgwame ge pecu kedeu gai, kedanemene pa Tinggwang de hetwa peu kemakne; nah pecu tangseudung ne tyei tsetdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:20">Dan. 5:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Dede Tinggwang sam kieesi nah mmi reureu lu.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Barnabas penai Saul penai bata teicang luge, penai John, Mark liede de qukelabe de ngngwalwe Jerusalem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung, </char><char style="fqa">penui Jerusalem gade cailigwanglu, de eh peila.</char> </note> ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Barnabas penai Saul de langkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Cu Antioch ngqwa ga caihakecime nah keledeumedung bam. Penui cai Barnabas nah Simeon (Niger<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Niger</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Latinme zi, cide pekie cai, “Tiak.” </char></note> lie qu kelabe), nah Cyreneme Lucius, Manaen (Herod deuceudibe de ngngwa lungh cuh kelube) nah Saul. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Penui Rampaube de reca nah mmwang kebamdau, Kemci Rabe rangdi, “Nnui a ziemne Barnabas penai Saul de keu ntsamlu maisia, Ih penaide qugai keluga heta tei kerane.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Penui mmwang nah kekie tei, nah penai reu gage penui ba hwa gai kelucai, penui penaide langgai.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul zierangta tei eh hebeuh ketei raitube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Cine Barnabas penai Saul de Kemci Rabe ne langgai eh penai Seleucia namdi ga hunglu; nah cikade penai liemtau pwa Cyprus duigwadeu ga miedi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Penai Salamis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Salamis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Cyprus gu namdi kemlang ge nah liemtaubam ge. Cide duigwadeu tingpi-kepetle bie bam. </char></note> namdi ga kebamdau, penai Jewme synagoguedung ga Tinggwang sam rangpwa mide ledeu. Penaide ngha kerane penai John Mark de ngngwala. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Penai duigwadeu pelane tetkah mie Paphos ga gwangcang luge, penai Jewme kenret caihakecibe ge, kehemeu ta keteime, pe zi Bar Jisu de daulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Aipau kemeu ta keteibe de deuceudibe, Sergius Paulus, mi kemriakme ge de nzang bamla. Aipau pei de Barnabas penai Saul de qugai, kedanemene pa Tinggwang sam kingnei neu kecune. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Dede Elymas “kehemeu ta keteibe” (kedanemene cide pe zi kie kecune), penaide reniadi delwe deuceudibe depeu pe kenlum gade nreudi kera teidi. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Dede Saul, Paul de qu kelabe de Kemci Rabe puipung eh pecu pie linggai <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />eh rangdi, “Nang herakesiabe na, nang au mide kecwa leune nah kesia leune le puipung. Nang au kesamsang leune ngauraube. Nang madaude Rampaube lampui kemzuidung tei ngkoi kecu mtak lakni? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Cu ainie, Rampaube ba nreu ga gwang zieda, nah nang n miak cit dizie. Nang tingkak ge tingnaimiak ngau lak.” Ge zette mwangzui nah kemui Elymas reuga gwangdi, nah pa tet twagwa eh mina de peu pe ba teu pecu teuswa kera peei ladi. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Deuceudibe cide teikedi ngau luge, pa nlumlu, kedanemene pa Rampaube ha rang keledeu de pe swagahsüt kedine.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pisidian Antioch ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Cu Paul penai pe zangme Paphos gade liem taugai eh Pamphylia deuzi Perga namdi ga <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamphylia deu Perga namdi ga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pamphylia cai Asia Minor deuceu ge, nah Perga cai Pamphylia gu namdi mlangtube </char></note>gwanglu. Dede John Mark lie qu kelabe penaide pütdi eh Jerusalem ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Dede Paul nah pe zangbe Perga gade mbeuh pwa Pisidia deuzi Antioch namdi ga gwanglu. Penai Sabbath benai synagogue ga lütlwe bamlu. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Hezai laisiu nah caihakecime rau kegaidung gade pei kegaicai, Synagogue ga muiteume penai dage sam langgai eh ranggai, “Zangbe kena, nnai minadungde kecungkegai sam rangkera bamcai, rang gailo.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Cine Paul saplwe pe hwagai eh rangdi, “Israelmedung nah nnui Tinggwang mie hing kelamedung, kingneilu. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Aipau Israelme Tinggwang de anui paumedung de kedetlu delwe penui Egyptme deu ga kelungh dau minadung de tei ngkiee beu, nah peba kengkieng le penuide cikade ngngwa mpetbeu. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Pa mmi riakdai kenzwa ge hetaideu ga penuide lia eh gwang. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Pa Canaan deuga heleuh hena de teingkap kedicai, pa anui leuhme de penui deu gum kera ziemne pwapeu. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Aidungde peciakne mmi 450 nsam ge keudi. Ma aidungde cang kedicai, caihakecibe Samuel ting kecang Tinggwang penuide tutiakmedung kaibeu. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Pecai Israelmedung hegwang ge peulo kiedi, nah Tinggwang penuide Benjamin leuhme Kish napei Saul de mmi riakdai ge ziemne pwapeu. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Tinggwang pecu hegwangbam gade keumpet kedicai, pa David de teucuh penui gwangpei teibeu. David ha Tinggwang zierang tei eh rangdi, ‘Ih Jesse napei David de a suida, pa a lungning pelane tei beuzie.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Pa pe sampet kai kebeu nzwa, mina aipaude leuhme gade Tinggwang Israel dage kelikelube Jisu de kaibeu da. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Jisu gwang kemakdwa, John Israelme pelane dage helung nreulwe duipum tei lulo zierang teigwang. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />John pe ta teicang gwang kecudau, pa minadung de keteu, ‘Nnui Ih caulie cet lano? Ih au pa ma. Dede kingneilu, mige a cai gwangzeu, Ih au pe picum de lwaklu duilie.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Mipeidung, sinamedung, Abraham namedung, nah nnui kakga Tinggwang miehing kelamedung, anui dage kelikelu samlia aide langgai beu delie. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kedanemene Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung, nah penui reu kedimedung, pecu ci luma, nah penui caihakecime samdung Sabbath msangne kepeide pecu mmau kegai gade teicang lu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Penui pecu teitsetlu kebui kie gede ngaulu meliede, penui Pilate de pecu teitset dilo kiedi. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Penui pe ha rauteu keladung pelane teicang dige, penui pecu cross gade teunghunglwe pecu herau gage kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Dede Tinggwang ketsai gade pecu kwak cuhlu. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Pecu Galilee gade Jerusalem ga ngngwa kehangmedung de peu tingba zie kekiee ge pecu ngaugai. Mina aidungde cu au minadung dage pe zierangme dida. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Nah anui nnui dage samliakeyi Tinggwang anui paume dage sampet gai kebeude rang gaila. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Kedanemene Tinggwang aipau sampetde anui penui namedung dage teicang beuda, Jisu de teucuh daikelu gade. Cide Leidung pekenabe gage rauteukela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Nang au a Napei, henai Ih n Pei dida.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Lei. 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Pa ketsai gade pecu kwak cuhlu, iciu eh pe pum madaude timrimdi kelakne, Tinggwang ainzwa ranggai:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ih ncu kemci nah ngaulu bi kera samlamdung David dage sampet kebeude peuzie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa. 55:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Cine pa Lei keda gade ainzwa rang gai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Nang n Kemci Nabe de peu timrim dilak.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Lei. 16:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Kedanemene David petingdau Tinggwang lungning tei eh pe gwatei luge, pa tsaidi, nah pecu pe paume rau tai gage kungdi nah pe paau timrimdi. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Dede Jisu Tinggwang ne kwakcuh kelubede au timrim dima. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Cine nnui cikap lulo, minadung, sinamedung, mina aipaude dade kemaudung gilukebui, nah Moses zai gade tei masang gaikelak kemau pelane gade lungmpetlu kebui nnuide ranglia beuda. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Pe pecu nlum kelume pelane de tei masang beuda. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Cine sünne lu, caihakecime rang kegaide nnuida gwang melu kerane:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Ainie, nnui mide mcaukelame, nnui swagahdi eh tsaidilu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kedanemene Ih nnui tingdau bata ge teibam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">nnui madaude nlum kelak bata ge, mina kangge nnuide cide ranglia lude.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab. 1:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paul penai Barnabas mpet keladau, minadung aipau samdung de pecaibe Sabbath de penuide ranglia dailo penai dade kiedi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Synagogue ga ngkwa cang luge, Jewme kekiee ge nah Jewme renet mzai kedi Gentileme makesangmedung Paul nah Barnabas caisuidi, penai penui dage sam ranggai eh penuide Tinggwang ngaugia ga lungh jüja la lulo kecunggai.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Pecaibe Sabbath benai, namdibe peciakne kenzwa ge Rampaube sam kiengnei kera gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Dede Jewme hemaabe de ngau luge, penui riak le puidi nah Paul ne kerang samdungde ga kesamlim di nah pecu kiidi. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Dede Paul penai Barnabas kuusüt eh samrang cuhdi, “Tinggwang sambe nnui dage ranglia rai maisiadi. Dede nnui cide mlaidi nah nnui kelungta kering ngaulu duilie kedine, ainie, anui Gentileme lam nreugwang dizie da. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kedanemene Rampaube ainzwa eh anui dage aja kaibeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ih nnuide Gentileme ziemne kebaa ge teilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">iciu eh nnui kideutu leune ga kelikelu teu gwang beulu kerane.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 49:6</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Gentileme aide siu luge, penui suiyi eh Rampaube sam de twadi. Kelungta kering ziemne kedet kelume leune nlumlu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Iciu eh Rampaube sam cuikui pelane ga rang gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Dede Jewme mipui kemlang nah kenlummedung nah namdi ga mipei hangkiamedung de kecunggai. Aide ne helung teigai eh Paul penai Barnabas de ngauraudi nah penaide penui namdi gade gwa mpetdi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Dede Paul penai Barnabas penuide kemmau gade penai pi ga rebui kecung mpetdi, delwe penai Iconium namdi ga miedi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Nah caisuimedung penui suiyi nah Kemci Rabe le kepui teidi.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Iconium ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Pecai Paul penai Barnabas Iconium namdi ga Jewme synagogue ga nzang lütlwe marang hemisüt gai ge Jewme nah Greekme maadi nlumlu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Dede samzai tei kemakme Jewme, Gentileme lung tei kebwak gai nah penui lung teimsia gai eh penui siname de mmau cuhdi. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Cine penai cika peting ketie ge bamdi, Rampaube ziemne kuusüt eh marang eh, nah pa Paul penai Barnabas de peu miswakegah nah mimakecang bata tei eh pe ngaugia sam kerang de kesang lie liagai. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Dede namdibe ga minadung de mzidi; kedanemene mi kangge Jewme lam pwadi, dede kangge langkegaime lam pwa kedine. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Dede Gentileme nah Jewme Paul penai Barnabas de teikeherei nah tangtsu le sam kera penui muiteume lung tei kera tei ge, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />penai cide cilu delwe Lycaonia namdi, Lystra nah Derbe nah twakengwa cuikui gage pak gaidi. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Cika de penai samliakeyi pau jüja bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lystra nah Derbe ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Lystra ga mige pe pi sia eh bam, pecu mna kelu gade pe pi swa eh pa madaude tet luma. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Mina aipaude Paul zierang tei kebam siulu. Paul pecu pie linggai nah pecu teingkeilu kebui kenlum kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Cine pa sahbak eh pe dage ranggai, “N pi cuh sap mzuilu.” Ge minabe nsau cuhlu eh tet tegwa ladi. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Maadibe Paul tei kegaide ngau luge, penui Lycaoniame let gade sahbak eh ranggai, “Rabedung mina nzwa anui da nghungbam dida.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Penui Barnabas de “Zeus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zeus</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zeus Greekme Tinggwang kakde ditube nah Hermes Greekme tinggwangdung gu sampauswa kelabe lie nlum la. </char></note>” nah Paul de “Hermes,” lie qudi, kedanemene pa makerang kenlangbe kecune. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Zeus cingkupei, pe recaki namdi taiga kebambe, ketumseu nah maparingoidung teu kiriebe ga gwang; kedanemene pa nah maadibe ratak teigai beu neu kedine. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Dede langkegaibe kena, Barnabas penai Paul cide siu luge, penai pai hietdi eh zette maadibe taiga mpetlwe sahbak eh, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />ranggai, “Minadung, nnui daitei aikenzwa tadung tei zeu no? Anaide nnui nzwa mina lungcet kebamme lie. Anai nnui dage samliakeyi paula, iciu eh peu nnuide kemta aidungde gade nreu pwa ringkela Tinggwang, tinggimdung, nah kideu, nah duidi nah cika kebam leune tei kegaibe da nreugwanglu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Gwang kedi mmidung ga, Tinggwang heleuhdung pelane de peu penui suibe tei eh lunghgwang. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Dede pa lalie kecu keulia mene ta dima, pa heta keyi tei eh peting pehidau tinggim gade tingrui nah meitsi builu kebui ting peula, ciu eh nnuide ketyeipok nah nnui nlung suiyi peula.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Aipau samdungde ranggai liede Paul penai Barnabas maadibe de peu penai dage ratak teibeu kera kaamlu pa sütdi. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Dede Jewme kangge Antioch nah Iconium gade gwang mina maadibe lung teigai. Cine penui Paul de tangtsule pwa sam nah pa tsaidi deha cet eh namdi gwale ge teukerei mpetdi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Dede kenlumme pecu sap twagwa kebamdau, pa cuhlwe namdi ga lütdi. Pecai benai pa Barnabas de ngngwalwe Derbe nam gage tet gaidi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Syria deu Antioch ga cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pecai penai samliakeyi namdi cika zierang teigai eh mina kekiee de kenlumme tei luge, penai Lystra, Iconium, nah Antioch ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Penai nlum kelume de tei ngkieng nah penui kenlum ga ntip bam lulo kecung eh ranggai, “Anui Tinggwang hegwangram ga keherei kekieege dau eh nlüt maisia.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Penai kekie tei nah mmwang eh penui ziemne ngqwa ramsang ga hangkiame kedet luge, penai penuide Rampaube penui nlum kelabe de nlum beudi. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Pecai penai Pisidia deuzi tetkah gwang Pamphylia deuzi ga gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Penai Perga namdi ga sambe zierang tei kelucai, penai Attalia namdi ga nghungdi. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Cikade penai liem gade Antioch ga gwangdi, cika penaide Tinggwang ngaugia gage kaipwa heta teilo nlum kebeu de cu teicanglu. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Penai Antioch ga gwanglu nah ngqwamedung de ngngwa ngkwa luge, Tinggwang penai da heta tei kegaidung, nah dainzwa pa Gentileme ziemne kenlum kikam letbeu bi kecu pelane paubeu. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Penai cika peting ketie ge kenlummedung de ngngwa bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ga ngqwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Ge Judea deuceu gade mina kangge Antioch namdi ga nghung nah kenlummedung de ledeu eh ranggai, “Moses zai gade nzwa nnui hegeurumlu mecai, nnui kelikelu ngau gailak.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Makie aide ziemne Paul penai Barnabas penuide ngngwa marang renia nah kesamlim sütdi. Cine penui Paul penai Barnabas nah kedame kangge de ngngwa penui kakgade Jerusalem ga mie langkegaimedung nah hangkiamedung de redau eh aipau hade mpau kerane kedetlu. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ciziemne penui, ngqwabe ne langkegai nzwa Phoenicia nah Samaria cuikui tetkah kegwangdau Gentileme dainzwa Tinggwang da nreugwang lu dibi kecu ha ranglia. Aipau hade kenlumme pelane de suiyi disüt kecu teugwang beu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Penui Jerusalem ga gwang luge, ngqwabe nah langkegaime nah hangkiamedung penuide ngaulu. Penui Tinggwang ngha gade penui ta teikelu leune paubeu. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Dede kenlumme kangge, Phariseeme maa ga kelame cuh saplwe rangdi, “Penuide hegeurum maisia nah Moses zai mzai kera penuide aja kaibeu maisia.” <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Cine langkegaime nah hangkiamedung makie aide mpau kerane gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Kesamlim süt kedicai, Peter cuhlwe penui dage rangdi, “Sinamedung, peting tie kemakge cai Tinggwang nnui kakgade acu peu Gentileme dage samliakeyi zierang tei kera kedetkelu nnui cibam, iciu eh peu penuide siu, nah nlumlu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Tinggwang, mina lung ci kelabe, penuide Kemci Rabe peu kegai gade penuide ngngwa kelu zierang teigai, pa anui dage tei kegaide nzwa; <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />nah pa anui nah penui kakga kentsam gede teigai ma, dede kenlum gade penui lung teimci beu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Cu ciziemne, daitei eh nnui anui paume nah anuide pungpai gai kelak ngwanggai pwa caisuime ngwang reu gage kai eh Tinggwang de kedak lano? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Dede anui Rampaube Jisu ngaugia gade penuide nzwa anuide kelilu kera nlum bamlie.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Pecai hemaabe Barnabas penai Paul Tinggwang penaide teu miswakegah nah mimakecangh batadung Gentileme kakga tei kegai ha pau kegai kingnei eh zing de bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Penui marang cangdi ge, James sam keli eh ranggai, “Sinamedung, a kwa kingnei gailo. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Tinggwang dainzwa keraibe Gentileme de ngaungia eh penui kakgade minadung gede pe zi ziemne ngngwalu dibi kecu Simon rang mci liagai da. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Caihakecime samdung de aide ga kesuizwalu, ainzwa eh Kesanglaisiu ga rauteula,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Ma aidungde cai Ih cailigwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">nah Ih David paiki kau kedide teidai luzie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">nah cide siakedidung Ih retak daizie nah pwa cuhdai luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 12:15">Jer. 12:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Ciu eh zang kela minadung de peu Rampaube de peeilu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Gentilemedung a zi qu kelume pelane de si eh.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">ainzwa eh Rampaube, ma aidungde tei kelube <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />ndaa gede aidungde peu ci kegaibe rangla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Rampaube, ndaa de pe tadung ci kelabe ainzwa rangla. </char> </note><verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />James rangsi eh, ciziemne, a kecet au, Tinggwang da nreu gwangkelu Gentileme de anui teikeherei kerabe ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Dede anui penui dage mamie kereca kehera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kehera: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehera ketsamtsam de rangbam, dede aika au makaune teih mamiedung de reca teibeu kedibe de rangbam. </char></note> gade, nah kemmha ta gade, nah kak ketset makaunedung teih gade, nah hejai ketyei gade penuide ketiplu maisia lie raugai maisia. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kedanemene ndaa gwangkedi ceheu gade Moses zaide namdi leune ga ledeu la dida nah Sabbath ramsang synagoguedung gade pe samdung peila.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngqwabe laisiu kaipwa Gentile kenlumme dage kepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Pecai langkegaime nah hangkiamedung, ngqwa pelane de ngngwa penui kakgade midung gede kedetlwe Paul penai Barnabas de ngngwa Antioch gage langgai kera kesuiswalu. Cine penui kenlumme kakgade muiteume Barsabbas lie qukela Judas penai Silas de langgai. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Penui penai dage laisiu aiznawa raulwe langgai: “Langkegaime nah hangkiame, nnui sinamedung Antioch, Syria nah Cilicia ga kebam Gentileme sinamedung de kelum gaila! <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Mina kangge anui dade magede keteu mene mie penui samrang le nnuide kebwak eh nnui lung teikeherei lie kecu anui siuda. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Cine anui gwang ngkwalwe mina kangge de kedetlwe nnui dage anui hungkelabe Barnabas penai Paul de ngngwa langgai kera kesuizwalu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi ziemne penai teilung kerehim gage kai kebeube kena. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ciziemne anui Judas penai Silas de langgai la, penai anui raukegai kesiak ge nnuide penai sam gade ranglia zie. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kedanemene kemci Rabe nah anui de nnui reu ga hepüt kerüt kai mene maisiabe aidungde kaide yitu kera cetlu: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />mamiedung de ratak teibeu kedi ketyeipok tyei so, nah hejai tyei so, nah kak ketset kaunedung tyei so, nah kemmha ta ketei gade nnuide kezeulu. Nnui aidungde mbai lucai, nnui yi luzie. Yi eh bamlu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Cine penui hang mdaibau, penuide lang kegai dau penui Antioch ga nghunglu; nah penui maadibe de qu hekwa luge, penui laisiu de peubeudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Penui laisiude pei kegaidau, kecung kegai samde ziemne penui suiyi sütlu. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Judas penai Silas, penaide caihakecime ge kecunzwa, kenlumme dage sam kekiee ge teu kecunggai nah penui kenlum teingkienglu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Penai cika tingkakge bam kelucai, kenlummedung penaide lungciep teu langcaili pwa penaide langkegaimedung dage langgai. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung pedum 34 de sila (Bata 15:40). </char></note>[Dede Silas cika bam kera pe suikidi.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Dede Paul penai Barnabas Antioch ga bamdi, mi kedame kekiee de ngngwalwe Rampaube sam ledeu nah zierang teibam di.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul penai Barnabas kesuizwa luta kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Dede peting tie kemakge cai, Paul Barnabas dage rangdi, “Cu anai cailigwang delwe anai Tinggwang sam teu zierang teikegai namdi leuna ga kenlumme de redau go, nah penui dainzwa bamla bi mie piego.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnabas Mark lie qu kelabe John de penaide ngngwa gwang neudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Dede Paul Mark de ngngwa mede yi lie cetdi, kedanemene Mark penaide Pamphylia gade gidi eh penaide ngngwa heta tei sita kedine. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ge cika kesamlim süt cuhdi eh penui hangge ge dade kelamtsamdi, nah Barnabas Mark de ngngwalwe liem gade Cyprus duigwadeu gage tet gaidi. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Dede Paul Silas de kedetlwe tetdi, kenlumme ne pecu Rampaube ngaugia gage kai pwapeu kedicai. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Pecai pa Syria nah Cilicia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Syria nah Cilicia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipau kena de deudi ket ket de kenna ga bam, nah Paul Barnabas de ngngwalwe pedwa de mie da. </char></note> cuikui ga tetkah gwang ngqwadung de teingkieng gai.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Paul zierangta tei eh hebeuh ketei kenabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paul Derbe nah Lystra namdi ga de gwanglu; nah ainie, caisuime ge pe zi Timothy lie kecuge cika bam, pa pui Jewme kenlumme pui ge dede pe pei au Greekme ge. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Lystra nah Iconium ga kebam kenlummedung pelane pecu rang hemisüt la. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paul Timothy de ngngwa mbeuh neudi; cine pa pecu ngngwalwe Jewme cika kebamme ziemne pe geurumlu, kedanemene pe pei Greekme gelie kecu penui pelane ci kecune. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Penui namdidung ga tetkah kegwangdau, Jerusalem ga kebam langkegaime nah hangkiame mpau kelu hezaidung de mzai lulo penuide ranglia beu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Iciu eh ngqwadung kenlum teingkienglu nah tingba ramsangne hemaa kiee silu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Macedoniame gede kengau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paul nah pe zangmedung Phrygia nah Galatia cuikuidung ga tetkah gwang, kedanemene Kemci Rabe penuide Asia deuceu ga samliakeyi zierang tei kera kaam kedine. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Penui Mysia deurai ga gwang luge, penui Bithynia ga lütkera teidi, dede Jisu Rabe penuide peu lüt ma. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Cine Mysia cuikui tetkah pwa Troas namdi ga penui nghunglu. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Ge tingmui Paul marengei ge ngau: Macedoniame ge mige saplwe pe dade pe nggia kie eh ranggai , “Macedonia ga gwang delwe anuide nghalo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Cine Paul marengei de ngau luge, anui zette Macedonia gage tetgai kera mteilu, Tinggwang anuide penui dage samliakeyi zierang tei kera qu zeulie nlum eh.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philippi ga Lydia helungkenreu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Troas gade liem taugai eh anui tetmzui pwa Samothrace duigwadeu ga mie, nah pecai benai anui Neapolis namdi ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Cikade anui Philippi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Philippi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namdi aide zi kehegwa cai Dathos. Namdi cide Alexander Kedibe pei Philip ne retak nah tei hezuyi lu.</char></note> gage tetgai, cide au Macedonia deuzi gade namdi mlangtube, nah Romme kangga kebam nam ge, nah anui aipau namdi ga tingbazie kiee kemakge bam. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Sabbath tingba benai anui namdi rieki gwale kereuki ga mie, cika kekie teikera heni ge bam ha de cet eh. Pecai anui bamlwe mipuidung ngngwa ngkwa kebamme dage marang gai. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mipui ge pe zi Lydia, Thyatira namdi ga gieremang pai zwa kecume ge, Tinggwang de kenlumme puige anui kwa kingneilu. Rampaube pecu peu Paul kerangde kingneilu kera pe lung ngkeibeu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Lydia nah pe nahpei duipum tei luge, pa anui dade kiegai, “Nnui kecet gade Ih Rampaube de kenlumme kesang gelie lacai, a kiga gwang eh bam lulo.” Iciu eh pa anuide gwang anui lung teilu.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul penai Silas hebaangki ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Anui kekie ketei henige ga mie keladau, rabe kengkieng teukela releipui gede anui redaulu. Pa reka sam kerang gade peu pe mpaume de mmisüt lula. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Aipau puide Paul nah anui caisui eh sahgai, “Mina aidungde au Hutube Tinggwang kilamedung. Penui kelikelu lampuibe nnui dage ndulia la.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Pa tingbazie kekiee ge ainzwa ladi. Dede Paul, cipau puide de lunglei zudi eh, nreugwang rabe dage ranggai, “Jisu Khrista zi gade Ih ncu pe dade mpet dilo aja kai gaila.” Cidau herakesiabe zette mpetdi.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Dede pe mpaume penui rangkang hilu kera ziuyi de gahkedi ngau luge, penui Paul penai Silas de tuilwe litakni ga kengkieng teu kelame dwaga penaide teu kerei gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Penui penaide Romme kedime da ngngwa gwang luge, penui rangdi, “Mina aikenade anui namdi teukebwak bam dida. Penai au Jewme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:17">1 Heg. 18:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Penai anui Romme zai kemak zaidung de luu lulo nah mzai lulo rangla.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Cidau hemaabe ncütlwe Paul penai Silas de mmau cuhdi, nah Romme kedime penai painidung hietdi delwe hegeutiedung le penaide daplo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Penui penaide pia kekiee ge dap kedicai, penui penaide hebaangki gage kelien gaidi delwe hebaangki kekwabe de penaide kwasiakte lulo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Hebaangki kekwabe aja de siu ngau luge, penaide hebaangki lung kecok gage banglwe penai pi tsingkang kerütdung gage kang nzeudi. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Tingmui muisum dauge paul penai Silas kekie tei nah Tinggwang de ketwa lei teibam, nah hebaangme kedamedung penai kwa kingnei bam. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Zette cika nluiteu sütdi, iciu eh hebaangki tsiadung teu kelaidi; nah zette kikamdung pelane ngkeidi, nah pelane dade hegeuriadung de nlwak mpetdi. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Hebaangki kekwabe zip kebam gade mrak gwanglwe hebaangki kikamdung ngkei pwa kebam ngau luge; pa pe kingtie züt mpetlwe pekatei pecu teitsetdi kera mteilu, kedanemene hebaangme pakdi de ha pa cet kelune. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Dede Paul sahbak eh ranggai, “Nkatei ncu tei rejam diso, kedanemene anui pelane aika bamlu.” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Cine hebaangki kekwabe kebaa kielwe paklüt, mbeu nah ngngi eh Paul penai Silas dwaga kauzeudi, <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />nah penaide teumpetlwe keteu, “Kedibe kena, Ih kelilu kerane daipai tei maisia no?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Penai keligai, “Rampaube Jisu de nlumlu, iciude ncu kelilu zie, nang de nah n kilungme de.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Penai pe dage nah pe kilungme pelane dage Rampaube sam ranglia. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Cipau ziu cipau bamdakkak dau hebaangki kekwabe penaide ngngwalwe penai zamdung huidi, nah zette pecu nah pe kilungme pelane de duipum teilu. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Pecai pa Paul penai Silas de pe ki ga ngngwa gwanglwe ketyeipok penaide kaibeu, nah pa Tinggwang de nlum kelu ziemne pe kilungme pelane de ngngwa pe suiyisüt bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Pecai benai tingcang, kedime kekwame dage, “Peu penaide tetdi lulo,” de sam kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Hebaangki kekwabe Paul dage sam paubeu eh ranggai, “Kedimedung nnaide peu tetdi lulo a dage sam langgai beu. Ciziemne mpetlu delwe nnai lung nciep eh tet lulo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Dede Paul penui dade rangdi, “Penui mteibe dwade hetutiak mene anaide dap, anai Romme deuketme ge liede, nah penui anaide hebaangki gage tuigai. Cu penui ngkim eh anaide langgidi neu lani? Lak! Meliene, penui depeu gwang eh anaide lungmpet lulo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Pecai hebaangki kekwame Romme kedimedung de sam aide paubeu, nah penui Paul penai Silas Romme lie kecu siu luge, penui ngngidi. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Cine penui gwang penai dade penui mau kie nah penaide lungmpet beu, nah namdibe gade tetdi lulo penai dade kiedi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Cine Paul penai Silas hebaangki gade mpetlwe Lydia kiga gwanglu. Penai kenlummedung de ngau ngau luge, penuide kecunggai eh namdibe gade tetdi.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Thessalonica ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Penai Amphipolis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amphipolis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Macedonia kepetle bie namdi sumbe.</char></note> nah Apollonia namdidung de tetkah gwang delwe Thessalonica namdi ga gwanglu, cika Jewme synagogue ge bam. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paul pe zai kecu nzwa cika lütlwe Sabbath kecum ge kesanglaisiu gade penuide ngngwa mpau. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Pa kesanglaisiu letlwe Khrista keherei nah ketsai gade ringcuhdai mai kesia ranglia mci gai. Pa rangdi, “Jisu Ih nnui dage pe ha paulia kebam aipaude Khrista da.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Jewme kangge helungnreulwe Paul penai Silas de ncütlu, Greekme kenlumme maadi ge nah mipui kenlangme kekiee gede silu. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Dede Jewme nlumkemakme penui riakdi eh litakni gade mina kesiamedung gede ngngwa gwanglwe maadi gede qu hekwalu eh namdi de tei kebwaksüt gai. Pecai penui mipei ge Jason lie qu kelabe ki kecung, ciu eh Paul penai Silas de mina dwaga teugwanglu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Dede penui penaide ngauluta dige, penui Jason nah kenlumme keda kang gede namdibe kengkieng teu kelame dwaga teukerei gwanglwe sahgai, “Kideu teu kebwak kegai mina aipau kenade aikade gwang bam dida. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />nah Jason pe ki ga ngngwalüt kelu mina aipau kenade hegwang keda ge, Jisu, bamlie eh Caesar zaidung mlai la dida.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Cine hemaabe nah namdibe kengkieng teu kelame, ma aidungde siulu ge penuide kebwaksütdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Dede kengkieng keteume Jason nah kedamedung dade rangkang keu kelucai, penuide peu tetdi.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Berea ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Cipau ziu kenlummedung Paul penai Silas de Berea namdi gage langgaidi. Penai cika gwang keludau, penai Jewme synagogue ga lütdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Berea ga minadung Thessalonica ga kebammedung swa penui lung mzuiki, kedanemene penui samliakeyi de penui lung pelane teu eh luulu nah tingnai ramsangne cipau samdungde kesang mi mebi kecu pie kerane kesanglaisiu pei mting bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Cine mina kekiee Khrista de nlumlu, Greekme kenlang puidung nah mipeidung de kekiee ge nlumlu. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Dede Thessalonica ga Jewmedung Paul Berea namdi ga Tinggwang sam teu zierang tei kebam ci keludau, penui cika mie delwe hemaabe de teu kebwak cuhdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Iciu ge kenlumme zette Paul de jaaidi lambie ge langgaidi, dede Silas penai Timothy cika bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Paul de nzang kemiemedung pecu ngngwa kemdei Athens namdi ga kecang gwang. Paul dade Silas penai Timothy de teilu kebuita peda kelwa gwang lulo kecu sam teulwe penui kilung caili gwangdi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Athens ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paul penaide Athens ga kwa kebamdau, pa namdi ga mamie le pui kebam ngau eh pelung keherei sütdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Cine pa synagogue gade Jewme nah Tinggwang de reca kelamedung de nah tingba ramsangne litakni gade pa redau kelume de ngngwa mpau bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Epicurean nah Stoic<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Epicureanme nah Stoicme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipau kena de au Athens ga laisiu kecime hemaa kena de rangbam. Epicureanme Tinggwang ne kideu damgai lie kecu nlum la ma. </char></note> keledeumedung kangge pecu rang reniadi. Penui midungge rangdi, “Aipau keheliabe de daipai rangneu lano?” Kedame rangdi, “Pa au sangme rabedung ha rang kebam nzwalie,” kedanemene pa Jisu ha nah ringcuhdai kecu samliakeyi ledeula kecune. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Penui Paul de Areopagus baudibe dwaga ngngwa gwanglwe rangdi, “Anui nang rangkela keledeu sam keheci aide cilu buimi? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Kedanemene nang maketsam ge anui da ga teugwangla. Ciziemne anui aide pekie daipai bi cineu lalie.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Cu Athenme pelane nah cika sangme lungh kebammedung ma keda gage mene maha keheci kerang nah kekingnei gage penui ting ngngwang bamla kelane.) <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Cine Paul Areopagus sum ga saplwe rangdi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:22">“Nnui Athenmedung, Ih kengau nnui maleune gade renet lam ncoksüt. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kedanemene Ih tetkah gwang eh nnui reca keladung mcet kegaidau, Ih recabam gage, “Cikemak Tinggwang dage,” de eh raupwa kebam de ngau. Cine nnui cisiakte mene recabam kelade, cide Ih nnui dage ranglia gaila. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Tinggwang kideube nah kideu ga kebam maleune de teikelube, pa au tinggim nah kideu reu Rampaube, mina ne teikelu kerecaki ga lungh lama. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Mede pa magede teumai kesia nzwa eh mina ba le pecu pwapeu lu kebui magede gah. kedanemene pane pekiene de keringria nah keringcui nah mapelane pwapeu delu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Tinggwang mige dade kideu pelane reu ga lungh kera mina leuh pelane teigai, nah penui lungh kera peting pehi nah kideu raidung riem pwala. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:8">Hez. 32:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Iciu eh peu penuide Tinggwang de peeilu kerane nah penuide pecu pei eh pecu ngau delu builu. Dede pa au anui mige dade de mdei lama. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Kedanemene anui pe dade ring nah nlai nah lungh bam, nnui lei kempwakme ge rang kegai nzwa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Anuide pe name delu.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Ciziemne, anui au Tinggwang name kecune, Rabe au kecak, mede rangkanggeu, mede tangtsu mina bata nah kecet gade teikelu recamie nzwa lie cet kerabe ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ciziemne Tinggwang anui kemie tingdung de ngau kemak nzwa gwang dida, dede cu pa keheileu ga mina leune de helungnreu lulo sam kaigai dida. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kedanemene pa kedet kelube de peu kesamsang gade kideube tutiak kera pa tingba ge riet luda. Tinggwang mina aipaude de ketsai gade kwakcuh kelu gade pa kesang lie kecu mileune de keulia gaida.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Cidau penui ketsaime ringcuhdai kelu ha siu luge, kangge Paul de keu henui teidi; dede kangge rangdi, “Anui aipau hade n dade kingnei dai neulie.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Pecai Paul penui kangbau gade tetdi. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Dede mina kangge pecu ncütlwe nlumlu, Areopagus baudi peupeime ge Dionysius, nah mipui ge pe zi Damaris, nah penuide ngngwakela kedadung de si.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Corinth ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ma aidungde tei kedicai Paul Athens pütdi eh Corinth namdi ga gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Pa cikade Jewme pei ge pezi Aquila, Pontus ga deuketme ge, pe nau Priscilla de ngngwa Italy deudi gade gwang bam eh pecu redaulu, kedanemene Claudius Jewme pelane de Rome gade tet dilo aja kai kegaine. Paul penaida gwang, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />pa de peta penai ta nzwa kecune, pa penaide ngngwa bam eh mata tei, penai paiki keteime. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Cine Paul Sabbath ramsangne synagogue gade mide mpau eh Jewme nah Greekme lung tei nreulu kera teila. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Dede Silas penai Timothy Macedonia gade nghung luge, Paul keledeu gage peting pelane kai eh Jewme dage Jisu au Khrista delie kecu zierang teigai. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Dede Jewmedung pecu renia nah kesiu kedidau, Paul pe nia kecung gai eh penui dage rangdi, “Nnui jai peu nnui katei nnui reuga gwang lulo; Ih a zie ma. Cu gade Ih Gentileme da gwang dizie da.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Nah pa cikade tet pwa Tinggwang de reca kelame peige pe zi Titus Justus ki ga gwangdi. Pe ki synagogue taiga bam. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Synagogue muiteube Crispus, pe kilungme pelane de ngngwa Rampaube de nlumlu; nah Corinthiame kekiee ge Paul sam siu kelume nlumlu nah duipum teilu. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Cidau Rampaube zeuziu ge marengei ge gade Paul dage ranggai, “Ngngi diso, dede rang jüja bamlu nah mlei mene bam diso. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Kedanemene Ih ncu ngngwala, nah migede ncu ketang eh tei rejam lak, kedanemene namdi aika a mina kekiee ge bamlu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Cine Paul cika mmi ge eh kei herok ge penui kakga Tinggwang sam ledeu eh bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Dede Gallio Achaia deuceu ga deuceudibe tei luge, Jewmedung ngngwa ket tei eh Paul de renia eh pecu tutiak bam dwaga ngngwa gwanglu; <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />penui rangdi, “Aipau peide hezaibe gikah eh minadungde Tinggwang de reca lulo kecung la dida.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Dede cidau Paul marang zielie cu ge, Gallio Jewmedung dage rangdi, “Nnui Jewmedung, magade cide matei mau kedige mede heta kesiage teidi kecuge liecai, nnuide ngngwa tutiak kera petau lubui. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Dede makie aidungde au samdung nah hezidung nah nnui katei nnui zaibe halu, nnui katei tiak lulo. Ih ma aidungde reu tutiakbe au teineu melie.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Cine Gallio tutiak bam gade penuide langgidi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Cine penui pelane synagogue reu kedibe Sosthenes de tuilwe tutiak bam dwaga de pecu dap. Dede makie aidungde ga Gallio pelung kai ma.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Priscilla, Aquila nah Apollos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paul tingbazie kekiee ge cika bamsi kelucai, kenlummedung de pütdi eh liem gade Syria deuceu gage tet gaidi, nah cika Priscilla penai Aquila de pecu nzangla. Pa pe sampet teipwa kelade ziemne Cenchrea namdi gade pe peu taidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:18">Pum. 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Penui Ephesus namdi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephesus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Asia Minor ga, namdi ge, Smyrna gade mile riakdai kenzwage. </char></note> ga gwang keludau, Paul Priscilla penai Aquila de cikade pütdi, dede pabe synagogue ga gwang delwe Jewmedung de ngngwa kempau bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Penui Paul de bamsi gailo kie kegaidau, pa lak liedi. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Dede pa penui dade tetcuh eh ranggai, “Tinggwang lungning liecai, Ih nnuida gwang daizie.” Iciu eh pa liemtau pwa Ephesus gade tetdi.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Paul Caesarea ga gwang luge, pa hang Jerusalem ngqwame de kelumgai eh Antioch ga nghungdi. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Tingkakge cika bam kelucai, Paul tetpwa Galatia nah Phrygia cuikui gadung mie delwe kenlummedung pelane de tei ngkieng gai.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Cidau Jewme ge pe zi Apollos, Alexandriame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Alexandria: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alexandria namdi aide Alexander Kedibe ne tum kelu nam, cide ndaa Egypt ga namdi ge.</char></note> ge Ephesus ga gwang. Mina aipaude marang cisüt nah kesanglaisiu de ci hemisüt kecume ge. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Apollos de Rampaube lampui lege ledeu gai kelume ge. Pa pelung kaisüt delwe Jisu ha ledeu beu dede pa duipum keteibe John ha de gwale cima. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Apollos kuusüt eh Synagogue gade marang mdeulu. Dede Priscilla penai Aquila pa ma kerang siu luge, pecu qu ntsamlwe pe dage Tinggwang lampui ha rang siakte liagai. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Pa Achaia ga kahpet neu kedidau, kenlummedung pecu kecung gai delwe Achaia ga kenlummedung dage pecu ngngwa lulo laisiu raugai. Pa gwang luge, ngaugia gade nlum kelumedung de pa nghasüt gai. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kedanemene Apollos pe sam ngkiengsüt eh mtei rang kerenia gade kesanglaisiu teu Jisu au Khrista delie kecu keulia eh Jewme de rang nggah kedine.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paul Ephesus ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apollos Corinth ga kebamdau, Paul deudi nreule de kahgwang eh Ephesus namdi ga gwanglu, nah cika ledeukelumedung gede ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Paul penui dage rangdi, “Nnui nlum keludau kemci Rabe ngau luni?” Dede penui pe sam keligai, “Ma, anui Kemci Rabe bam lie kecu hade siu ma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Cine Paul rangdi, “Iciucai nnui dai gage duipum tei luno?” Penui keligai, “John duipum de gage.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Cine Paul keligai, “John helungkenreu duipum teu eh duipum tei. Pa minadung de pecai gwang kelabe cide Jisu de nlumlu maisia lie ranglia gai.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Minadung cide siu luge, penui Rampaube Jisu zi gade duipum teilu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Nah Paul pe ba hwapwa penui reu gage kaigai ge, Kemci Rabe penuida gwanglu nah penui helet ketsamtsam gade marang nah caihakecisam de rangdi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Penui pelane ge mipei kereikena kenzwa ge.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pecai Paul synagogue ga gwang kuusüt eh kei cum ge marang gwang, Tinggwang hegwangram ha mpau nah penui lung kecungsüt eh. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Dede Jewmedung kangge penui lung tak eh nlum tadi nah penui hemaabe dwa gade Rampaube lampui de rangmsia cuhdi. Cine Paul penuide pütdi eh kenlummedung de ngngwa delwe tingnai ramsangne Tyrannus kibung kedi gade ngngwa mpau bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Aide mmi kena ge teigwang, iciu eh Asia ga kelunghme leune, Jewme de, nah Greekme de, Rampaube sam siulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Tinggwang peu Paul ba gade miswakegah bata kedi teigai, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />iciu eh baneu paidung nah hegwapaidung pecu tung kedibe pwa keteeime de peu kegaidau penui dade mateei gahdi nah herakesiabe penui dade mpetdi. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Jewme kangge herakesiabe de gwa kelame cipau cuikui ga mbeuh gwangla. Penui Rampaube Jisu zi teu herakesia ngngwa kelame de gwa kera tei eh rangdi, “Paul pe ha rang kela Jisu zi gade, Ih nnuide mpet dilo aja kaila.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Cika mikangge Jewme cingkupei kedibe Sceva<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sceva: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide Greekme zi, dede pe ha aika gwale bam si ma.</char></note> kibaume, pe name hang henabau aide teibam. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Dede herakesiabe penui sam keliai, “Ih Jisu de ci nah Ih Paul de ci; dede nnui cauno?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ge herakesia peda kelabe de penui reu gage nsaugai eh penuide ngamlu nah penuide rejam sütdi. Pecai penui paini teu mene nah rejamdi delwe penui cipau ki gade pakdi. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Nah aide Ephesus ga kelunghme pelane Jewme de nah Greekme de ci gwangdi. Ge penui pelane ngngi di nah Rampaube Jisu zi de herüt peulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Nah kenlumme kekiee ge gwang eh penui mau pet nah penui makesiabe tei kedidung ranggai. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Kereka ta tei kelame kekiee ge penui laisiukwakdung pwagwang hekwalwe mina pelane miakngau gade rudi. Pecai penui cidungde mi peigai, ge cide rangkanggeu cangriakngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu cangriakngei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu ge tingnaige ziehi nsam. </char></note> migedi. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Cine Rampaube sam rangpet si nah ngkieng reureu lu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Cu Paul Ephesus ga peta teicang kelucai, pa Jerusalem ga kemiedau Macedonia nah Achaia cuikui kahgwang kera cetlu. Pa rangdi, “Ih cika gwang lude, Ih Rome namdi de gwang maisia reu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Pecai Paul pecu ngha kebam hangna Timothy penai Erastus de Macedonia gage langgai. Dede pa Asia deuceu ga tingkak ge bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus ga kehebwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Cipau tingdau Ephesus ga kesangbe Lampui hade ziemne kehebwak kedige bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kedanemene rangkanggeu kerekime ge pe zi Demetrius rangkanggeu lepwa Artemis recakidung tei eh heta keteimedung depeu mmisüt lula. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Cine pa heta cide tei kelame de qu hekwalu rangdi, “Mipeimedung, anui heli aide gade rangkang kekiee ge ngaulu kela nnui cibam. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Nnui ngau nah siubam, Paul aipaude Ephesus ga rünne ma, dede Asia pelane ga mina de kecung mina kekiee ge lung teinreu dida. Pa mina bale teikelube au rabe melie rangla. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Cine anui heli aide de rangmsiadi kera kerehim rünne ma, dede herabe pui kedi Artemis recaki de de kemta liedi lubui. Ciciu eh Asia pelane ga nah kideu ga reca kela rabe pui kendu gah dilai zeuda.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Penui aide siu luge, penui rata le kepui tei eh sahbak gai, “Ephesame Artemis au dizu lie.” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Ge namdi pelane ga kehebwak le puidi, nah minadung renia eh kenggwaki ga gwanglu. Penui Paul de ngngwa mbeuh kela Macedoniame Gaius penai Aristarchus de tuilu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paul mina kakga lütneu di, dede kenlummedung pecu kaamdi. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Asia deuceu ga kedimedung pe zangme kangge de pecu kenggwaki ga lüt helo sam langgai. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ge midungge sam ge sah, nah mikedame kedage sah bamdi, kedanemene hemaabe ga kehebwak bam kedine. Penui kekiee ge dai ziemne penui gwang ngkwa bambi kecu cima. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Cidau hemaabe kakgade Jewmedung ne Alexander de keraile ge cwak mpet gai. Alexander hemaabe dage pe nzeu rang neu eh pe ba hwagai. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Dede penui pa Jewme gelie kecu ci luge, penui pelane kwa ge teidi. Penui bamdakkak kena kenzwa ge ma sah jüja bamdi, “Ephesame Artemis au dizu lie.” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Namceu ga keraube maadibe de kesiuzingdi eh pa ranggai, “Nnui Ephesamedung, Ephesus namdi ne kedi Artemis kerecaki nah mamie tinggim gade cak kemie kekwabe lie kecu cauge ci kemak bamno? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ma aidungde mlai gai kelak ngau eh nnui sünne bamlu maisia nah magede kelwa eh tei kerabe ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Kedanemene nnui ngngwa tutiak bamga kegwang mina ai kenade kerecaki gade marega mede anui rabepui de rang msia ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ciziemne, Demetrius nah heta keteime pecu nzang kelamedung keheibede de kemmau bamcai, tutiak kidung ngkie pwabam nah deuceudime bam. Penui depeu ketket de mmau lulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Dede nnui makie kedabe peei lacai, cide hetutiak kela tingdaune tiak zie. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kedanemene henai kehebwak teikedi de ziemne anuide mmaulu kera kengngi bam dida. Anui aipau kehebwak de ziemne Romme kedime dage magede ranglu kera pekie gah.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Pa aide rang kelucai, pa hemaabe depeu lamnadi, </char> de kecude pedum 41 gage mene aika ge kaila.</note> <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Pa aide rang kelucai, pa hemaabe depeu lamna di.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Macedonia nah Greece kahkegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Makehebwak de cang dige, Paul kenlumedung de qugai eh pa penuide kecunggai, pecai pa kelamna sam ranggai eh Macedonia ga mie kera tetdi. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Pa cipau cuikuidung ga kahgwang eh sam kekiee ge rangpwa penuide teingkuu kegai cai, pa Greece deudi ga gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Pa keicum ge cika bam kelucai, pa liem gade Syria deudi ga mie lai eh kebam dau Jewme pecu mmau kera ciem riemlu, cine pa Macedonia lamde cailigwang kera cetlu. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Pecu nzang kelamedung cai Bereame Pyrrhus napei Sopater, nah Thessaloniame Aristarchus penai Secundus, nah Derbeme Gaius, nah Timothy, nah Asia cuikui gade Tychicus penai Trophimus. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Dede mina aidungde anui dwa gwanglwe Troas ga anuide kwabam. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Tsehikaikemak tangku keru Ngyi cang kedicai anui Philippi namdi gade liemtau gai, nah lang mengei ne kakgage anui Troas namdi ga penuida gwanglu. Cika anui lang hena ne bamdi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Troas gade Eutychus de ketsai gade teucuh kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Pecai mtakkak zie raitu benai, anui tangku pang tyei kera gwang ngkwa luge, Paul kenlummedung dage marang. Pa pecai benai tetdi kera riem bam, cine pa tingmuisum kecang marang jüja bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Anui ngngwa kangbau kebam kibung nreube ga mibung kekiee ge mtau bam. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Hebaki taiga rehangme ge pe zi Eutychus ntumbam, nah pa ziep zing miedi. Paul marangtie kedi dau aipau rehangpei de ziepmang eh kiset pekecumbe gade cakmie tsaidi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Dede paul nghunglwe pe reu ga keumie pecu tuipwalu. Pecai pa rangdi, “Nnui lung keherei sita dilu, kedanemene pa ring bamlu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:21">1 Heg. 17:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Pecai pa nreule nghang dailu delwe tangku panglwe tyeilu. Pa penuide ngngwa peting ketie ge baareirang kecu kecang mpau bam eh tetdi. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Cine penui rehangna de ring eh ngngwa gwanglu nah penui lung nciep nieplu.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus ga hangkiame de yibamlo Paul kenuikegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Dede anui Paul dwa rai eh liem ga mie delwe Assos namdi gage liem taugai, cikade anui Paul depeu liem ga nlütlu kera cet eh. Pa aide tei kera pekatei mteilu, kedanemene pa pe pile tetgwang kera riem kelune. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Pa anuide Assos gade dau luge, anui pecu liem gage ngngwa gailu delwe Mitylene namdi ga gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Pecai anui cikade liem taugai eh pecai benai duigwadeu Chios de mcwa kebam ga gwanglu. Pecia benai duigwadeu Samos ga gwanglu, nah pecai benai anui Miletus namdi ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paul Asia gage peting nggwangdi melu kerane Ephesus liemtau kahdi kera cetlu; kedanemene pa teilubui cai, Pentecost benai Jerusalem ga gwanglu kerane kelwa kelane.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Cine Miletus gade pa Ephesus gage mide langgai eh ngqwa ga hangkiamedung de qu nggwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Penui pe da gwang luge, pa penui dage rangdi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 20:18">“Ih Asia ga gwangkelu raitu benai gade dainzwa eh Ih peting pelane nnuide ngngwa bambi nnuikatei cibam. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Jewme ciemdung ziemne a da kehereisüt kecu kegwang daude, Ih henah cangsiak eh a miakdui lwa eh Rampaube gwatei gwang. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Nnuide nghalu kebui sam Ih magede ranglia mene nnui dade kainzeudi kemak, nah Ih dainzwa mteibe dwagade nah kige gade kige ga lüt eh Ih nnuide ledeubi kecu nnui cibam, <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Jewme nah Greekme de Tinggwang dage helungnreu lulo nah anui Rampaube Jisu de nlum lulo zierang tei kecu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Cu pielo, Kemci Rabe samzai tei eh Ih Jerusalem ga gwang laizeu, cikade a dage daipai tei ziebi ci mene, <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Kemci Rabe ne a dage hebaang ketei nah keherei kecu rünne namdi leune ga acu kwabam lie kerang de gwale. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Dede Ih a ta nah Rampaube Jisu acu teilo kebeu zierangta, cide Tinggwang ngaugia samliakeyi zierang sünne eh ranglo kebeude tei canglu kera gwale, Ih akatei de a teilung au magede melie cetla. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Cu ainie, Ih Tinggwang hegwangram ha zierang tei eh nnui pelane kakga gwang da nah nnui a zu ngaudai kelak Ih cibam. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ciziemne Ih henai nnui dage rangla, nnui keheibe kapdi liede, a zie melie. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kedanemene Ih Tinggwang lungning pelane nnui dage ranglia mene kaizeu pwa bamdi melu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Nnuide nah Kemci Rabe nnuide pie kerengeibe tei kebeu meurünhau pelane de pie teune lulo. Tinggwang pa pekatei pe jai le pwa luikelu ngqwa de kwa kera sünne lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:2">Lei. 74:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ih tet kedicai mina heneu pe zaikesiabe nzwa nnui kakga gwangzie nah meurünhau de mbaibeu kelak Ih cibam. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Nnui kakgade de mina kangge kenretdung rang gwang zie nah kenlumme de penui lambie teu gaidi zie. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Cine mriak bam lulo. Ih mmi kecum ge mtak mene a miakdui lwa eh tingmui tingba nnui pelane de ledeugwang kecu nsung lulo. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Cu Ih Tinggwang nah pe ngaugia sam, cide nnuide tei hemi beulu kebui nah nnuide kemcime pelane kakga nnui qwa peulu kebuibe dage nnuide nlumgai beula. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ih mige gu rangkanggeu mede kecak mede paini de hengin ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 12:3">1 Sam. 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Ih aipau ba kena de keu a ziemne nah acu ngngwa kelamedung teumaikesiabe teigwang kecu nnuide cibam. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Aidung pelane gade Ih nnuide Rampaube Jisu samdung, “Ngau kelube swa au mide kepeube samlam pungki lie,” de kerang de nsunglwe anui matatei nri eh mnei kelamedungde ngha maikesia keulia gaida.<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paul aidungde rangcang kedicai, pa keumie koktung delwe penui pelane de ngngwa kekie tei. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Ge cika penui pelane hapsüt eh Paul de tuipwalwe pecu kemamgai. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Penui suisia kidi, kedanemene penui madaude pe zu ngau dailak delie de pa rang kegai ziemne. Pecai penui pecu liem ga ngngwa miedi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ga gwangkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Anui kelamna di eh liemtau keladau, anui mzui jüja Cos duigwadeu ga gwanglu, nah pecai benai Rhodes duigwadeu ga nah cikade Patara namdi gage tetgai. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Anui Phoenicia deudi ga liem tetkah gwanglai kebam ngau luge, anui cika nlütlwe liem taugai. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Cyprus kengau ga gwang luge hile de liem taupwa Syria gage liem taugai nah Tyre ga gwanglu, kedanemene cikade liem pepüt limpet lai kezeune. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Pecai anui kenlumme de ngau luge, anui cika lang hena ne bamdi. Kemci Rabe gade penui Paul de Jerusalem ga mie helo rang bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Dede anui cika kebam ting cang dige, anui lampui le ge tet gaidi nah penui pelane, penui nau nah penui namedung de ngngwalwe anuide namdi gwale kecang nzang miebeu; nah duidikung ga anui koktungmie kekie teigai, <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />nah anui hangge gede kelamna sam ranggai. Cipaucai anui liem ga nlütlu, nah penuide kilung ga caili gwangdi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tyre gade anui liembeuh cang dige, anui Ptolemais<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ptolemais: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Namdi aide Mediterranean jaaidi kung ga bam. </char></note> ga gwanglu, ge anui kenlummedung de kelumgai nah penuide langnaige ngngwa bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ge pecai benai anui tetgai delwe Caesarea namdi ga gwanglu. Anui samliakeyi kerangbe Philip kiga nlütlu, pa de hang hena kakgade hangge nah anui pecu ngngwa bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Cu aipau peide pe napui relei kemcime hang mdai caihakecisam kerangme bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28">Joe. 2:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Anui cika tingbazie kekiee ge bam kedicai, caihakecime ge pe zi Agabus Judea gade hung. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Pa anuida gwang Paul kiakang keulwe cide le pa pekatei pe pi nah pe ba kanglwe rangdi, “Kemci Rabe ainzwa rangzeu, ‘Jerusalem ga kebam Jewme kiakang aide mpaube de ainzwa kanglwe penui pecu Gentileme ba gage tuigai beu dizie.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Anui aidungde siu luge, anui de nah cika kelunghme Paul de Jerusalem ga nghang helo kiegai. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Iciuge Paul sam keligai, “Nnui daitei zeuno, ainzwa hap nah a mlung tei keherei kecu? Kedanemene Ih hebaang ketei rünne ma, dede Rampaube Jisu zi ziemne Jerusalem gade tsai kerade mtei luda.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Anui Paul lung tei nreu luta dige, anui mtakdi eh ranggai, “Peu Rampaube lungningbe tei lulo.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Tingbazie aidungde cai, anui guniadung mteilwe anui Jerusalem ga nghangdi. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Caesarea gade kenlumme kangge de anuide ngngwalwe mie delwe Cyprusme kenlumme teikelu keraime ge pe zi Mnason anui gwang bam zielie kecube pei ki ga anuide ngngwa gwangbeu.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Jerusalem ga gwangkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Anui Jerusalem ga gwang luge, kenlumedung penui suiyi süt eh anuide ngngwalu. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Pecai benai Paul anuide ngngwalwe James taiga gwang, nah cika hangkiame peciakne de bam. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paul penuide kelum kelucai, Tinggwang pe zierang ta gade Gentileme kakga tei kegaidung ket ket eh pa ranglia. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Penui cide siu luge, penui Tinggwang de twadi, nah penui pe dage ranggai, “Nang pielo, sinabo, Jewme kakga kenlumme cang dai kieege bambi, penui pelane de hezai teu ntip sütla. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Penui nang Gentileme kakga lungh kebam Jewme pelane dage Moses zai de gidi lo, nah penui name de hegeurum helo, mede kehegwa zaidung de gidi lo kecu, nang penuide rang ledeu beulie n ha rangla dida. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Cine anui daipai teilai? Nang gwangbam delie kecu penui siubi zieda. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Cine anui n dage rangkebeube aide nang tei lulo. Anuida mipei hang mdai penui sampet tei kelume bam. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Nang aidungde de ngngwa lwe ncu tei mcilu nah penui ziedung de tei beulu, iciude penui penui peudung taidi lubui. Ciciude mina peciakne n ha penui dage rang kebeude kesang melie kecu nah nang hezaide mzai siakte lalie kecu ci luzie. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Dede Gentileme nlum kelume ziemne au, anui penuide mamie kereca gudung gade, nah hejai ketyei gade, nah makauna kaktset kedibe teih gade, nah kemmha gade penuikatei de ketiplu maisia lie kecu laisiu raugai nah rangbeu dida.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Cine Paul pecai benai mina hangmdai baude ngngwalwe pecu tei mcilu, nah kerecaki ga lütlwe penuide tei kemci ta daidau cang ziebi nah penui hangge ge ziemne daidau reca tei ziebi ndulia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Pum. 6:13-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul de tuikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Dede tingbazie hena de cangdilai kezeudau, Asia gade Jewme kangge Paul de kerecaki gade ngau luge, mina maa pelane de kebwak gai delwe pecu tuilu. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Penui sahbak eh ranggai, “Israelmedung, anuide nghalo. Minadungde de, hezaibe de nah heni aide de mmau eh luga aika mie mi leune de ledeu kelabe de mina aide da. Ci rünne mene, pa Greekmedung de kerecaki ga ngngwalüt eh heni kemci aide teihera dida.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Kedanemene penui pa ndaa Ephesame pei Trophimus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Trophimus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa Ephesus gade Paul de pe lampui ga kangzang gwang. Bat. 20:4. </char></note> de namdi ga ngngwakela kengaune, penui Paul pecu ngngwa kerecaki ga lütlie kecu cet kedine. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Jerusalem namdi pelane de kebwakdi, nah minadung ngngwa pakgwang Paul de tuilu. Penui pecu kerecaki gwale teukerei mpetlu delwe zette kikamdung ngkuidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Penui pecu teitset kera tei kebamdau, reugwame muibe da Jerusalem peciakne kebwak bamdi delie kecu sam ci gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Pa zette reugwame nah haireu kedimedung de ngngwalwe hemaabe da pak nghung. Minadung reugwa muibe nah reugwamedung de ngau luge, penui Paul de dap tadi. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Ge reugwa muibe petai nnagwang Paul de tuilwe hegeuria kena le pecu kangdilo beu. Ge pa caubi nah pa daipai tei dibi keteu. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Dede hemaabe kangge mage sah nah kedame kedage sahdi. Reugwa muibe magede ci siaktelu tadi, kedanemene makwa kebwaksüt kedine, pa Paul de kengkieng reketbam ga ngngwa lüt lulo aja kaibeu. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pa pihidok ga nghang keladau hemaabe kuusüt kedine, reugwamedung pecu pwa maisiadi. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kedanemene mina hemaabe pecai sui gwang sahbak eh, “Pecu teitset dilo!” de kedine.<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul maadibe dage samkerang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Paul de kengkieng reketbam bam ga ngngwa gwang lai kezeudau, pa reugwa muibe dage keteudi, “Ih n da mage ranglu buimi?” Kedibe pei keligai, “Nang Greek kwa rangla mi? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Nang Egyptme pei gwang kedi tingdau ge kehebwak ndeu eh, ‘Teiketsetme’ mina cang mdai de hetaideu ga teuswa mpet kedibe de meni?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Dede Paul keligai, “Ih au Jewme, Cilicia deuzi ga Tarsusme ge kesang lie. Ih au Tarsus namdi kemlang cide ga deuketme gelie. Ciziemne, acu peu minadung dage marang lo, Ih n dage kiela.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Kedibe pecu peting peu kegaidau, Paul pihidok reuga saplwe minadung matu helo pe ba hwagai. Cidau zingde dige, pa penui dade Hebrewme let gade marang. Pa rang cuhdi,<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Sinamedung, nah a peimedung, cu Ih nnui dage a nzeu kerang kingnei gailo.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Hemaabe Paul penui dage Hebrewme let gade sam kerangde siu luge, penui zingde kidi. Pecai pa rangdi,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ih au Jewme pei ge, Cilicia ga Tarsus namdi gade acu mnalu, dede aipau namdi Jerusalem gade Gamaliel kangga de maci peeilu. Acu anui paumedung zai rehi gade mtingsüt eh ledeu beu. Henai nnui pelane nzwa eh Ih de Tinggwang ziemne a lung neisüt lie. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Ih aipau Khrista Lampui de caisuikelame de mipei de nah mipui de kanglwe penuide hebaangki gage kai eh ketsai kecang teikeherei, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />cingkupei kedibe de nah hangkiamedung a a zierang aide tei lubui. Ih penui dade Damascus ga kebam siname ziemne laisiu ngaulu, nah cika kebammedung de tuiteu Jerusalem ga ngngwa cailigwang penuide saja peu kerane Ih cika mie kesang da. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Ih Damascus ga mbeuh nna gwang ge, tingna hige zette Tinggim gade baaha kecuge acu gi mbaa twagwadi. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ge Ih hangdeu ga kaumie nah makwa ge a da rang eh siu, ‘Saul, Saul, nang daitei acu teikeherei lano?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Cine Ih keligai, ‘Nang cauno, Rampaubo?’ Ge pa a dage rangdi, ‘Ih au Nazarethme Jisu, nang teikeherei kelabe.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Acu ngngwa kelame kebaa cide ngau kesangda, dede a dage makerang kwade penui ci luma. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Pecai Ih ranggai, ‘Ih dai teilai, Rampaubo?’ Rampaube a da ranggai, ‘Cuhlu delwe Damascus ga miecu, nah ncu peu tei zielie nlumpwa kebam leune cikade ncu ranglia zie.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kebaa de ziemne Ih mangau ta kedine, acu ngngwa kelamedung ba teulwe Ih Damascus namdi ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Cika Ih Ananias lie kecu pei gede daulu, hezai ga ntipsüt kelame ge nah Jewme cika lungh kebam pelane pe ha rang hemisüt bamla. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Pa a da gwang a taiga saplwe a dage ranggai, ‘Sinabo Saul mangau lulo.’ Cipau ting siakdau Ih pecu ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Pecai pa rangdi, ‘Anui paume Tinggwang peu pe lungning cilu kerane, nah Kesangbe de ngau eh peu pe mui gade kepet kwade kingneilu kerane ncu kedetlu. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ciu eh nang ngau nah siu keludung de mina pelane da nang pe zierang teilu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Cu nang daitei kwa bamno? Cuhlu delwe duipum teilu, nah pe zi qu eh n maudung hui dilu.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Joe. 2:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Ih Jerusalem ga caili gwang dailwe kerecaki ga kekie tei bamge, Ih marengei ge ngau. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ih pecu ngau, pa a dage rang eh, ‘Kelwalu, Jerusalem gade zette tet dilu, kedanemene penui nang a ha zierang ketei luu laklu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Ih ranggai, ‘Rampaubo, penui penuikatei de Ih synagogue pelane ga ncu kenlumme de dap delwe hebaangki gage kai kela cibam. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />N zierang keteibe Stephen de teiketset dau, Ih de cika sap eh kesuizwa bam, nah pecu teitset kedime painidung Ih kwabam.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Dede pa a dage rangdi, ‘Miecu, kedanemene Ih ncu kemdei Gentilemedung dage langgai zielu.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Romme teikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Pa aide rang kecu kecang penui pe sam kingnei bam. Pecai penui sahbak eh ranggai, “Cikenzwame depeu kideu gade tet dilu, kedanemene pa ringbam kera petau melu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Penui mrung nah penui niadung keliengi nah tambüt tingkai gage keliengai kebamdau, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />reugwa muibe Paul de kengkieng reketbam ga ngngwalüt dilo aja kaigai. Penui daiziemne Paul de ngaurau eh sah bambi kecu cilu kerane pecu dap eh keteu lo sam kaibeu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Dede penui pecu dap kerane kang luge, Paul haireu kedibe pe taiga sap kebambe dage rangdi, “Nnui Romme gede pe tutiak mene dap kera cide nnui hezai deni?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Haireu kedibe aide siu luge, pa reugwa muibe da mie delwe peda ranggai, “Nang daipai tei laino? Aipau pei de au Romme deuketna lu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Cine reugwa muibe peda gwang eh keteu, “Acu ranglia lo, nang Romme deuketna ni?” Paul keligai, “Yeo, Ih Romme deuketna lie.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Pecai reugwa muibe keligai, “Ih deuketna tei kera rangkang kekieege le luilu.” Dede Paul rangdi, “Dede Ih au, mnakelu gade Romme deuketna gelie.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Pecai pecu ma keteu zielie kelame zette pecu gidi. Reugwa muibe de Paul Romme deuketna lie ci luge pa ngngidi, kedanemene pa pecu kang kedine.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanhedrin dwaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Pecai benai, reugwa muibe Jewmedung daitei Paul de mmau bi kecu kesangbe ci neudi. Cine pa pecu hiakdi delwe cingku kedimedung nah baudi pelane de gwang hekwa lulo aja kaigai. Pecai pa Paul de ngngwa nghunglwe pecu penui dwaga peu saplu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pecai Paul baudi peupeime de pielingci gai eh rangdi, “Sinamedung, Ih henai kecang Tinggwang dwagade a lungcet petau eh lungh gwang lie.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ge cingkupei kedibe Ananias pe taiga kesapmedung de pe mui gage kepeu lo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Ge Paul pe dage rangdi, “Tinggwang ncu kepeu lai zeuda, nang tangdeu pwet ha pwa kebambo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tangdeu pwet ha pwa kebambo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Helung hera eh hezai tei kecime. </char></note> Nang hezaibe gade a tutiak zielie bamni, dede nang hezaibe gikah eh acu kepeu lo zeuni?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Dede cika kesapmedung rangdi, “Nang Tinggwang cingkupei kedibe de kii zeuni?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Cine Paul rangdi, a sinamedung, “Ih pa cingkupei kedibe lie kecu cima, kedanemene Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rau pwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 23:5">Nang n minadung reu hegwang gede de rangmsia so.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Tet. 22:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paul baudi maage Sadduceeme nah keda maage Phariseeme kecu ngau luge, pa baudibe dage sahbak eh maranggai, “Sinamedung Ih au Phariseeme ge, Phariseeme napei ge. Ketsaime ge ringcuhdai kera keregui hade ziemne a tutiak bam.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Pa aide rang kegaidau, Phariseeme nah Sadduceeme kakga kesamlim cuhdi eh hemaabe mzi tsamdi. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Kedanemene sadduceeme ketsaime ringcuhdai kecu, mede tinggimgwamedung, mede rabedung gah lie rangla, dede Phariseeme au cidung pelane bamlie la. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Cine kebwak mdisüt cuhdi, nah Phariseeme maa ga hezai keledeume kangge cuhlwe rang reniadi, “Anui mina aipaude da kemau gede ngau luma. Dede rabe ge mede tinggimgwabe ge pecu mpau mi?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Cika kesamlimsüt kedidau, reugwa muibe mine Paul de teurak kecaidi kera hingdi, cine pa reugwamedung de nghung delwe baudi peupeime kakgade pecu teu mpetlwe pecu kengkieng reketbam bam ga ngngwa gwang lulo aja kaigai.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Dede cipau ziu Rampaube pe taiga saplwe rangdi, “Kuulu Paul, kedanemene nang Jerusalem ga a zierang tei kegai nzwa, Rome namdi gade de nang a zierang tei maisia lu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul de teitsetdi kera ciem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Pecai benai, Jewme kangge heciem ge riemlu, penui Paul de teitsetdi kemakta matyei masak laklie sampetlu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Heciem cide riem kecume mina riakdai swade kiee bam. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Penui cingkupei kedimedung nah hangkiamedung da mie delwe rangdi, “Anui Paul de teitsetdi kemaktane matyei laklie reset gele anuide kang dida.” <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Cu, ciziemne, nang baudibe de nzanglwe reugwa muibe dade Paul ha ci mcineu kecu ciem teilu, iciude pa pecu nnuida ngngwa nghungbeu zie. Pa aika gwangcang kemakdwa anui pecu teitsetdi kera mtei luda. <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Dede Paul tipui napei mi pecu swa pwabam lie kecu siulu, cine pa kengkieng reketbam ga gwanglwe lüt Paul dage ranglia beu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Cine Paul haireu kedime hangge de qulwe rangdi, “Rehang aipaude reugwa muibe da ngngwa gwang beulo, pa pe dage madungge ranglia kera bamlie.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Cine haireu kedibe rehangbe de reugwa muibe da ngngwa gwanglwe ranggai, “Paul hebaangtei kebambe acu qulwe acu rehangpei aipaude de n da ngngwa gwang beulo zeulie. Pa n dage madungge rangkera bamlie.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Cine reugwa muibe pe ba teulwe pecu teu ntsamlwe keteugai, “Nang acu ranglia kera kelade daipai no?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ge rehangpei rangdi, “Jewmedung kesamteilwe ncünne peu ncu Paul de baudibe da ngngwa nghung kera kie zielie bam dida, penui pe ha madungge ci mci keneu ciem teilwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ciziemne nang penui sam kingneidi kerabe ma, kedanemene mina riakdai swade kiee eh pecu swa pwabam. Penui pecu teitsetdi kemaktane matyei masak laklie penuide reset gele kang pwabam dida. Cu penui nang sam kaibeu kera kwabam.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Cine reugwa muibe rehangbe de, “Nang a dage ma aidungde kerangde midage de rang helo,” degai eh peu pecu tetdi.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul de Caesarea gage langgaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Pecai haireu kedibe hangna de qulwe ranggai, “Caesarea namdi ga kecang mie kera reugwame haina, hekwen keteume riakhena, hengei kepwame haina mtei lulo. Penui tingmui bam hekui dau tet zie. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Pa Paul de punglu kera makaunedung de mteigai beulu delwe pecu deuceudibe Felix<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Felix </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa Judea deuceudibe, Pezi cai Antonius Felix.</char></note> da ngngwa gwang teune beulo eh penuide aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Pecai pa laisiu ainzwa raugai. <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Claudius Lysias ne yikemtingbe deuceudi Felix dagekekai: kelum gaila. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Mina aipaude de Jewme ne tuilu nah penui ne pecu teitset dizie lie bam. Ih pa Rome deuketme lie kecu ci luge Ih a reugwame de ngngwa penui dade pecu kelilu. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Pecai penui daiziemne pecu mmau bambi kecu Ih cineudi, cine Ih pecu penui baudi da ngngwa hung. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ih penui katei penui zai hale pecu mmau kebam cilu, dede pa tsailu kebui mede hebaang tei kera kemau gede teima. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Pecai pe dage teigai kera heciem riem kebam acu ranglia, cine Ih zette pecu langpwa n dage kaila, nah pecu mmau kebamme dede gwang n dwade pecu kemmau sam rang lulo beu dida.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Cine reugwame penuide aja kai kebeu nzwa Paul de ngngwalwe pecu tingmui gage Antipatris nam ga ngngwa gwangdi. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Pecai benai, reugwame kekiee ge kengkieng reketbam ga caili gwangdi, dede penui hekwen keteume de Paul de ngngwa gwang lulo beudi. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Hekwen keteume Caesarea ga lüt luge, penui laisiu de pwa deceudibe de peudi delwe penui Paul dede pecu ngngwa gwanggai beudi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ge deuceudibe laisiu de peigai delwe Paul de dai deuceu gade gwang lano keteu. Pa Ciliciame lie kecu ci luge, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />pa rangdi, “Ih n ngauraume de aika gwang lude n sam kingnei siakte zie.” Pecai pa pecu Herod hegwangki gage kainzeu lulo aja kai beudi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Felix dwade tutiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Lang mengei cia, cingkupei kedibe Ananias, hangkiamedung, nah marangkeci muiteume ge pe zi Tertullus de ngngwalwe cika mie. Mina aidungde deuceudibe dwade Paul de kemmau sam ranggai. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paul deuceudibe dwaga sap luge, Tertullus Paul de mmau cuh eh deuceudibe dage rangdi, “N ziemne anuida kezuyi kedi bam luda, nah n mariem keyine anui leuhme de ma keyi kekiee ge teugwang beuda;<verse eid="ACT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />keheidaude nah keheiga liede anui aide ci eh ncu twa bamla, Yikemtingbe Felix. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ciuliede, ncu kesa tie sütdi neu ma, cine ngaungia eh anui kwa kingnei gailo Ih n dade kiela. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Kedanemene mina aipaude ma kebwak kela kauge nah kideu ga Jewme pelane reuga kehebwak teugwang gai kecu anui ngaulu. Nah pa au Nazarenme maa ga muiteume ge. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Pa kerecaki tei heradi kera de tei, cine anui pecu tuilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga pedum 6 kekamde, pedum 7, nah pedum 8 keraibe de sila. </char></note> [Anui pecu anui zai rehi gade pe tu tiak neula. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Dede kedibe Lysias gwang eh pecu anui ba gade anui kemei tei eh ngngwa teudi. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Nah Lysias pecu mmau kelame de n da gwang lulo aja kaigai.] Anui pecu mmau kela hadung de cilu kerane nang nkatei pecu ma aidungde pelane ha keteu lubui.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Iciu eh Jewme kedame pecu nzang kelame de kemmau aide kesang delie kesuizwalu.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Pecai deuceudibe Paul de marang culo peungum gai, ge Paul keligai, “Nang mmi kekiee ge aipau leuhme reu tutiakpe tei kegwang Ih ci, cine Ih a sui yisüt eh a nzeu rangla.”<verse eid="ACT 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ih Jerusalem ga reca zielie eh nghang kelu ziangreikena gwale si mereu lie kecu nang ci luzie. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Penui acu kerecaki gade migede de ngngwa kesamlim eh, mede synagoguedung gade nah namdi gade Ih hemaabe de teu kebwak bam eh ngauma. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Penui cu acu kemmaudung de penui n dage rangmci gailak. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Dede Ih aide n dage rang gaila, cide Ih penui maulie kera Lampui de mzui eh anui paume Tinggwang gwa teila. Ih au hezaibe gade teikela pelane ga nah caihakecime rauteu keladung ga masang bam. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mina aidungde keregui kebam kesiakge Ih de Tinggwang da keregui bam, cide mina makesangme de nah kesia keteime de ketsai gade ringcuh daizie lie kecude.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Cine aide ziemne, Ih Tinggwang nah mina pekiene dwade ma pelane ga a lungcet mci bamlu kerane a laikai teibam muila. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Cu mmi kekieege caine Ih a minadung de rangkang mapeu keugwang beu kera and Tinggwang de reca teibeu kerane Jerusalem ga cailigwang. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Ih aide tei kebam dau acu mmau kelame Ih kerecaki ga tei kemci zai teicang kelu ngaulu, cika hemaa gede mede magede kehebwak bam ma. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Dede cika Asia gade kegwang Jewmedung kangge bam, penui n dwaga gwang eh acu mmau kera bamcai penui katei mmau kerabe. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Mecai, mina aidungde de peu Ih Jewme baudi dwaga kesapdau penui daipai kemau a dade ngaulu dibi peu ranglo, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ih penui kakga kesapdau ma aide sah kegai gwale ma, ‘Ketsaime ringcuh daikera hade ziemne, henai nnui dwade a tutiak bam.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Pecai Felix, Lampuibe ha cimci kebamne, tutiak de tei nridi. Pa rangdi, “Lysias reugwamuibe Jerusalem gade nghung keludaune Ih nnui ha tiak beuzie.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Pecai pa haireu kedibe de Paul de kainzeu lulo, dede pecu kezeu süt helo nah pe zangme pe gwatei kebamme de kaamdi helo aja kaigai.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Tingbazie dungge cai, Felix pe nau Drusilla,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Drusilla: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa Herod Agrippa napui. </char></note> Jewmepui gede ngngwalwe caili gwangdai, nah mide peu Paul de qu teugwanglwe pa Khrista Jisu de kenlum ha pa pe dade siulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Dede Paul pecu ngngwa makesang, mikatei mide kezeu kecu, nah gwangkela hetuketiak ha pecu ranglia gai ge, Felix ngngidi eh rangdi, “Nang cu tet dilu. Dede Ih peting keyi ngaulude, Ih ncu qugai daizie.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Cipau tingdau pa Paul dade rangkang de ngaulu kera regui bam, cine pa pecu qu nah pecu mpau bam bamla. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Dede mmi kena cang dige, Felix cia Porcius Festus ne deuceudibe teidi, dede Felix Jewme suiyi teineudi, cine pa Paul de hebaangki ga peu bam jüja di.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Festus dwade tutiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Cu Festus deuceu ga gwang luge, lang cumne cai, pa Caesarea gade Jerusalem ga nghang. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Cingku kedimedung nah Jewme kemlangme Paul de kemmau samdung Festus da teugwang, nah penui pecu kecung eh <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Paul de mmau kera kengha kiedi—Festus depeu Paul de Jerusalem gage qu gailu kerane—kedanemene penui lampuiki gade pecu teitsetdi kera mtei kebamne. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Cine Festus Paul de Caesarea gage kainzeu lie, nah pa cika matie mene mielai zeulie sam keligai. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Pa rangdi, “Cine nnui kakga muiteumedung de peu anuide ngngwa cika mielu. Paul madungge teimau pwa bamcai, penui depeu pecu mmaulu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festus penuide ngngwa langhesetne mede ziangrei ge swa Jerusalem namdi ga bamsi ma, nah pecai pa Caesarea ga nghungdi. Pecia benai pa tutiakbam ga bamlu eh Paul de peda ngngwa gwanglo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paul gwang luge, Jewme Jerusalem gade kehungmedung pecu sap twagwalu eh penui rangmci liagai kelak pecu kemmau sam kekiee teugwang. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paul pe nzeu rangdi, “Ih Jewme zaide mmau eh, mede kerecaki zai mmau eh, mede Caesar de mmau eh magede teimau ma.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Dede Festus, Jewme suiyi teineu eh Paul sam keligai, “Nang Jerusalem ga hang eh cikade acu peu n ha aidungde tiakneu lani?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Dede Paul rangdi, “Ih Caesar tutiakbam dwaga sap bam, cikade a acu tiak kerabe. Nang cisiakte kebam nzwa Ih Jewme dage magede teimau ma. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Dede Ih kemau tei kesang pwa bamcai nah tsailu kebui kemau ta kehei gede teinzeu liecai, Ih tsai laklie dilak. Dede penui acu mmau kera magede gahcai, migede acu penui ba gage kai gailak. Ih Caesar dade a nzeu rang zie.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Pecai, Festus baudibe de ngngwa mpau kelucai, pa keligai, “Nang Caesar da n nzeu rang zielie zeu; nang Caesar da mie zie!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festus hegwangpei Agrippa suiketeu kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Cu tingba ziedungge cai, Hegwangpei Agrippa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hegwangpei Agrippa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aika raupwa kelade au Agrippa pe kenabe da. Herod Argippa keraibe napei, Bat. 12:1 Bernice, be Herod Agrippa keraibe napui kecingtube pui da nah Agrippa pe kenabe tipui. </char></note> penai Bernice Festus de kerüt peugai kera Caesarea ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Penai cika tingbazie kekiee ge bam kedicai, Festus Paul ha pwa hegwangpei dage liagai. Pa rangdi, “Aika Felix ne mipeige de hebaangme ge tei eh kainzeu pwa bamlie. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ih Jerusalem ga kebamdau, cingku kedime nah Jewme hangkiamedung mina aipaude de kemmaudung teu gwang pecu mmaudi lo kiedi. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ih penui dage kemmaube de ziuyi keyi peu eh pecu mmau kelamedung de peu kezungau eh pecu kemmau samdung de ziemne pe nzeu rang kemakdwa migede de mmau kecu Romme zai melie keli beudi. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Cine penui aika ngngwa gwang luge, Ih kwadi ma, dede pecai benai Ih tutiakbam ga bamlwe Ih Paul de ngngwa lütlo aja kaigai. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Pecu mmau kelamedung sap luge, Ih cet kelanzwa penui pecu kemmau kesia kette teugwang ma. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Meliene, penui katei penui renet ha gade nah mige pe zi Jisu, tsai kedibe de Paul pa au ring lalie kelade ziemne penui ngngwa kesamlim. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Cine Ih aipau hadungde dainzwa tiak gwangzie bi cet cilu tadi. Ih pa Jerusalem ga gwang delwe cikade cidungde ha tiak neumi mebi keteu. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Dede Paul hegwangpei depeu tiak kera kwa kebamdau peu pecu hebaangki ga bamlo kie dige, Ih pecu langpwa Caesar dage kailu kemakne pecu hebaangki gage kainzeu lulo aja kaibeudi.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ge Agrippa Festus dage sam keligai, “Ih, akatei de, mina aipaude sam kingnei gaineu bamlie.” “Ncünne,” Festus rangdi, “nang pe sam kingnei luzie.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Agrippa dwaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Cine pecai benai, Agrippa penai Bernice mtei hemisütlwe reugwame kedimedung nah namdi ga mina kemlangmedung de nzanglwe baudi kibung ga lütlu. Festus aja kai kegaidau, Paul de ngngwa lütlu. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ge Festus rangdi, “Hegwangpei Agrippa, nah aika anuide ngngwa kebammedung, nnui mina aipaude de ngaubam, Jewme maadibe pelane Jerusalem gade nah aikade de a dage pecu ncam bam, pecu peu lungh bam kerabe melie sah eh. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Dede Ih pa tsailu kebui mau gede tei nzeu kemak cilu; kedanemene pa pekatei hegwangpei dade pe nzeu rang zielie kedine, Ih pecu langdi kera cetlu. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Dede Ih pe ha hegwangpei dage mcigi kecuge raugai kerage de bam ma. Aipau kiede ziemne Ih pecu nnui dwaga ngngwa gwang luda, nah keraide n dwaga, hegwangpei Agrippa, iciu eh aikade pe ha pie kelucai, Ih madungge raukera bamlu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kedanemene a kecet au hebaangme gede pecu mmau kecubedung rau mcigai mene langkegai au pekie gahlu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Cine Agrippa Paul dage rangdi, “Nang n nzeu ranglu buida.” Ge Paul pe ba hwagai delwe pe nzeu rangdi.<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Hegwangpei Agrippa, Jewmedung acu mmaukela pelane ziemne, Ih henai n dwade a nzeu rang lai eh kebam ziemne Ih akatei acu nggim lie cet bamlie; <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />keraide nang Jewme zaidung nah kesamlim keladung pelane cikap kecune. Cine a sam kingnei sünne gailo Ih n dage kiela. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Ih a henane gade, raitu gade a leuhme kakga nah Jerusalem ga dainzwa lunghcuh bi kecu Jewme pelane cibam. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Penui raitu gade acu cibam, penui zierang tei neu cai, Ih anui renet maa ga ncoktube, Phariseeme ge tei eh lungh gwanglie kecu zierang tei lubui. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Anui paume dage Tinggwang sampet kebeude ga a keregui kebam ziemne Ih cu a tu tiak eh aika sapbam. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Kedanemene aipau sampet de ngaulu kerane anui leuhme kereikenadung de penui lungsang tei eh Tinggwang de tingmui tingba recala. Hegwangpei Agrippa, aipau keregui de ziemne Jewmedung acu mmau bam delie. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Daitei Tinggwang ketsaime de kwak cuhlu kelude nnui nlumgai lak dino? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Ih akatei de Nazarethme Jisu zi de mmau eh Ih ma kekiee ge tei maikesia cetla. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ih ma aidungde Jerusalem gade teida. Ih cingkupei kedime dade samde ngaulu eh kenlummedung kekieege de hebaangki gage kaidi, penuide teiketset dau Ih de penuide mmau kecu ga a ba hwa gaida. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Pia kekiee ge Synagoguedung pelane gade de penuide teikeherei nah Ih penuide peu penui kenlum rangmsia kera tei. Ih penuide ngaurausüt eh sangme nam ga kecangde gwang Ih penuide teikeherei. <verse eid="ACT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ih aide tei kebamdau, Ih cingku kedime dade kengkieng nah aja keulwe Damascus namdi ga mie; <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />nah tingna tingding dau lampui gade, Hegwangpei, Ih kebaa ge tingnaimiak swade baaki kecu tinggim gade kehung ngau, nah cide acu nah acu ngngwa mbeuh kelamedungde taumbaa twagwa lu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Anui pelane hangdeu ga kauzeu dige, Ih makwa ge Hebrewme let gade a dage rang eh siu, ‘Saul, Saul, daitei nang acu teikeherei lano? A lungning de gikah delwe acu renia kela au n ziemne kemta lie.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ge Ih rangdi, ‘Rampaubo, nang cauno?’ Ge Rampaube keligai, ‘Ih Jisu nang teikeherei kelabe. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Cu cuhlu delwe saplu; kedanemene heta aide teikerane Ih n dage acu liagai delu, ncu kedetpwa a kila teikerane nah nang acu kengaude nah Ih ncu keulia keradung teu eh a zierang teikerane;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:1">Eze. 2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />nah Ih ncu n minadung dade nah Gentilemedung dade kelibeu zie, nah Ih ncu penui dage langgai zie,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:35">1 Hel. 16:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />iciu eh penui miak tei mrakgai delwe penuide peu kemui gade kebaa gage nreugai lu kerane, nah Satan kengkieng gade Tinggwang da nreugwanglu kerane, iciu eh penui maudung gikelu ngaulu nah acu kenlum gade teimci kelumedung kakga penui bam ngaulu kera ziemne.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Ciziemne, Hegwangpei Agrippa, Ih tinggim gade kegwang marengei kengaude mzaita dima; <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />dede, keraibe Damascus ga kebamme dage, nah pecai Jerusalem ga, nah Judea cuikui pelane ga, nah Gentileme dede, penui mau petlwe Tinggwang da nreugwang lulo nah heta keyi tei eh helungkenreu de luulu kebui teilu lo Ih ndulia dida. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Aide ziemne Jewme aidungde kerecaki gade acu tuilwe acu teitsetdi kera tei. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ciziemne henai kecang Tinggwang ne ngha kebeune, Ih aika sap eh keceu kedi pelane dage zierang tei, makeda gede rang ma, dede caihakecime nah Moses penai kerang de tei gwang zielie— <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />cide Khrista keherei gai eh ketsai gade cuh raitube tei eh pa kebaabe pwa anui leuhme nah Gentilemedung dage ndulia kecu deda.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paul ma aidungde rang eh pe nzeu rang kedicai, Festus sahbak eh ranggai, “Paul, nang mie dida; nang maci zu kedine ncu teimie dida.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Dede Paul keligai, “Ih au mie ma, yikemtingbe Festus, dede Ih au kesangbe nah kemcing samdung rangbam. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Hegwangpei aipau hadungde ci kebam, cine Ih de kuusüt eh pe dage marang gai, kedanemene aidungde kette pe dade mbaigai kelak Ih cibam; kedanemene aide kimiak ge gade tei melu. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Hegwangpei Agrippa, nang caihakecime de nlum ni? Nang nlum kecu Ih ci.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Ge Agrippa Paul dage ranggai, “Peting kedui aide gade nang acu peu Khristianme teilu kera a lung tei zeu ni?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Dede Paul keligai, “Peting keduina ge mede peting ketie ge liede, Ih Tinggwang dade a kekie au, nang rünne ma, dede henai a sam siukelu pelane Ih nzwalu kerade delie, dede aipau hebaangki geuriadung si mene.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ge hegwangpei, nah deuceudibe, nah Bernice, nah penuide ngngwa kebamme cuhlu; <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Penui tetmpet kelucai, penui hangge gede resiu eh, “Mina aipaude tsailu kebui mede hebaang teilu kebui ta magede tei pwabam ma,” dedi. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Cine Agrippa Festus dage rangdi, “Mina aipaude Caesar dage kiegai melie cai pecu lungmpet peudi lubui dege.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paul Rome gage liem taugaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Anuide peu liem gade Italy deudi gage tetgai zielie mtei luge, penui Paul nah hebaangme kedadung de pwa Augustus reugwa ga haireu kedibe Julius ba gage nlum beudi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Iciu eh anui Asia deuceu liemtau bamdung ga gwang zielie kebam Adramyttium liem ga nlütlwe anui liem taugai. Thessalonica namdi ga kebam Macedoniame ge, Aristarchus, anuide nzangla. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Pecia benai, anui Sidon namdi ga gwang canglu, cikade Julius Paul dade pe zai yi eh pecu pe zangmedung da mie kera peu iciu eh pa penui ngha ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Cikade anui jaaidi gage tetgai nah Cyprus duigwadeu nreule gade liemtau gwangdi, kedanemene tingkai anui dwa lede gui gwang kelane. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Anui jaaidi gade Cilicia nah Pamphylia de tetkah luge, anui Lycia namdi Myra ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Cikade, Alexandria gade liem ge Italy ga gwangkela ngaulwe haireu kedibe anuide cika peu lütlu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Anui tingba zie kekiee ge liemtau mneu süt eh tetgai nah kehereisüt eh Cnidus namdi taiga gwangcang luge, tingkai peu anuide cilambie gwangsi tadi, cine anui Crete kung gade liemtau gwang, Salmone namdi de gwang mcwalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Cine anui kehereisüt eh duikung kemna ga tetla, nah anui heni ge Kekwak Liemtaubam lie qukela ga gwang canglu, cide Lasea namdi taiga.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Dede peting ketiee ge ngngwangdi, nah liem beuh ketei kengngi bamdi, kedanemene Jewme kemmwang tingde cang kedine. Cine Paul penui dage ma ranglia eh cu, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Minadung, Ih a kecet anui dui gade kembeuh rezam zie nah kapsüt zie, mania nah liembe rünne ma, dede anui keringriabe de.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Dede haireu kedibe Paul ne kerang samdung swade liem keteube nah liem mpaube sambe kingnei kidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kedanemene liemtaubam cide ga tingtiak ting ngngwang kera petau kemak ziemne, liem ga kelame kekiee cikade tet pwa teilu buicai Phoenix liemtaubam dega gwanglwe cika tingtiak ting ngngwang kera cetlu—cide Crete ga liemtaubam ge, naimiak kenlüt tingpile nah naimiak kenlüt tingpeule bie mcwabam.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rahang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Tingpile tingkai gui mtei mene gui kegwang dau, liem keteume penui teu maikesia de penui ngaulu delie cetdi. Cine penui liem geukang de teu ncuhdi eh Crete kung kemna ga tet ladi. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Dede zette, tingkai kechi, “Northeaster” lie qukela duigwadeu lamde guigwang. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Tingkai kechi de guigwang liem de sam nah liembe tingkai de lie gailak dige, anui tingkai kechide de peu liem gui keling pwa ladi. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Cine anui tetpwa Cauda de qukela duigwadeu keceu nage kungga tetgwang nah teipasüt eh liemceuna de kezeulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Penui liemceuna de teucuh luge, penui heriadung gele liembe kang ntip sütdi. Penui liem guipwa Syrtis heciang gage kaidi kera hingdi, cine penui liem paide tei henah ngkeidi eh peu tingkai de liem guipung ladi. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Dede rahang dene anuide gui kelien msiasüt kedine pecai benai penui liem gade maniadung kesa kelien gi cuhdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Lang pekecum benai de penui liem nia kesa kelien gidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Tingbazie kekiee ge tingnaimiak mede hegidung de ngautadi, nah rahang disüt bam kedine, anuide kelilu kera keregui kette gahdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Penui matyei mene peting ketiee ge la dige, Paul liem ga kelame dwaga saplwe rangdi, “Nnui minadung, nnui a sam kingneilwe Crete gade tet tadi kerabe, iciucai aipau keherei nah kekap de mbai luzie nage. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Dede Ih cu nnuide kuu lulo ranggaila, kedanemene liem de rünne gwale nnui kakga keringria gede gah dilak. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kedanemene n zieziu Ih pe gwatei kela nah Ih pecu recakela, Tinggwang samgwame ge gwang a taiga saplwe <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ranggai, ‘Ngngi so, Paul. Nang Caesar dwaga sap maisia, nah ainie, Tinggwang n ziemne pe ngaugia gade ncu ngngwa liem ga kela leune de teilung kelibeu da.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ciziemne, minadung nnui lung kuu lulo! Kedanemene Tinggwang a dage kerangde siakte teilu kera Ih nlum kelane. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Dede anuide duigwadeudung ge gage kaibeu bizie.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liem siakedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Tingmuiziu kereimdai beziu gwang cang luge, anuide Adriatic jaaidi gade gui kelien nghung nghang eh keladau, muisum ting dauge liem keteumedung penui hangdeu ge ga gwang nna la delie cetdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Cine penui dui kecok mdet pie, ge feet haige ngkai kecu ngaulu; dede penui manage tetpet gai eh penui dui kecok mdet dai nah penui pecok feet haige ngkai bam eh ngaulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Anui tsura reuga gwangdi kera penui hing kedine, penui liemgeukang mdai liem cailede teu henah miedi delwe tingba pet kera kie bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Dede liem keteume liem gade pakdi kera mtei bamdi nah liemceuna de jaaidi gage teu henah mielwe liem geukangdung de liem dwagade pwa nghung kera ciem tei bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Dede Paul haireu kedibe nah regwamedung dage rangdi, “Mina aidungde liem ga bam mecai, nnuide keli gailak.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Ge reugwame liemceuna riadungde dangdi eh peu cide pung tetdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Tingba pet rage, Paul penui pelane de matyei lulo rangbeu. Pa rangdi, “Nnui magede tyei mene kwala kedi henai tingba ziangreimdai benai dida. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Cine Ih nnuide ketyeipok kesa tyei lulo kecung gaila, cide nnuide tei ngkieng beuzie. Nnui peu gade tam lei gede gah dilak.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Pa aide rang eh tangku keu luge, pelane dwade pa Tinggwang de twagai. Pecai pa tangku panglwe tyei cuhdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Iciu ge penui pelane de teingkuulwe penui ketyeipok tyeilu. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Anui pelane ge keringria 276 liem gala. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Penui matyei nggei luge, penui jaaidi gage wheat keliengai eh liembe teimca lu. <verse eid="ACT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Tingba luge, penui hangdeu cilu tadi, dede penui duidi kemza ge pe kung si eh ngaulu, nah cikage liem teunlüt lubui mi de penui mpau. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Cine penui liem geukangdungde hiaklwe jaaidi gage kaidi nah penui kehereudung kangpwakela riadungde hiakdi, delwe liem dwale kela paide tingkai gage teuncuh gailwe penui rejaaikung lebie tet gaidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Dede penui duicui kena keredau heni gega gwanglu nah liem be nyasai gage ntaudi. Ge liem dwale rapwa bamdi eh nlailu tadi, dede liem caile duicui kengkieng ne teipangdi. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Reugwamedung hebaangme de peu migede de duikung ga zak mpet eh pakdi melu kerane penuide teitsetdi kera riemlu. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Dede haireu kedibe Paul de kelilu neudi, cine pa penui ciem de kaamdi, nah pa dui zaklu kebuime dui gage nsaugai railwe kecang ga mpet lulo aja kaibeu. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Pecai kedamedung pelane, kesame tsingpak nah kesame ma kedabe liem gade kempetdung pinglwe penui cai sui lulo beu, ainzwa delwe anui pelane kwak eh kecang ga mpetlu.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paul duigwadeu Malta ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Anui kwak eh mpet luge, duigwadeu cide de Malta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Malta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sicily kung gade Malta de mile 60 kenzwage. </char></note> lie la kecu anui cilu. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Cika kelunghme anuide ngau kenggia kecu rünne ma, dede cika tingrui jüja kebamne nah ngkungsüt kecune penui mi teilwe anui pelane de cika ge qu gailu. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paul tsingtiedung peei hekwalwe mi gage pwa gaige, mi lum kecu ziemne henei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Henei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide henei ra süt kecuge de rangbam. </char></note> ge pakmpet pe ba ga ngoipwa bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Cika kelunghme henei pe ba ga nzu kebam ngau luge, penui hangge ge dage rangdi, “Mina aipaude mide teiketsetme jaaidi gade pak kelume ge au zieda, dede kesamsangbe peu pecu ringkera peu meda.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Dede pa henei de kezit pwa mi gage kaidi, nah pecu magede tei dima. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Dede penui pa mma cuh eh mede zette kaumie tsai dizie ha de kwabam. Dede penui peting ketieege kwa bamde ma ketsam gede peda gwang kecu ngau mege, penui penui lung kedilwe pa au herabe ge liedi.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Cu heni cika kenna ga mige pe zi Publius lie kecu duigwadeu kedibe gu hangdeudung ge bam. Pa anuide ngngwalwe anuide nggia eh langcumne hegia beu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Cidau Publius pei mra eh mateei nah pepok sia eh zeubam. Paul pe da gwang nah kekie teigai, nah pe reu gage pe ba hwagai eh pecu teingkei beu. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ma aide tei kedicai, duigwadeu ga keteeime kedame leune de gwang nah teingkeilu. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Minadung anuide mta ma kekiee pwapeu, nah anui tet kera mtei kebam dau, penui anui teumai kesiabe pwapeu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Rome ga gwangkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Iciu eh keicum gecai, liem Alexandria gade kegwang, Nedui Rabe le pe peumie teipwa kebam liem, tingtiak ting duigwadeu ga kebam ge gade anui tetgai. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Anui Syracuse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Syracuse: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide Sicily duigwadeu namdi sumbe, naimiak kepetle kung ga. </char></note> namdi ga gwang cang kelucai, anui cika lang cumne bamdi. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Cikade anui liemtau daipwa Rhegium namdi ga gwanglu. Langnai ge cai tingpile de tingkai gui cuhdi, nah langnane gage anui Puteoli namdi ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Anui cika sinamedung gede ngaulu, ge anuide lang hena ne penuide ngngwa bam lulo di. Iciu eh anui Rome namdi ga gwanglu. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Cikade kenlummedung, anui hadung siu luge, Appius Litakni nah Hebeuh ki Kecum dei ge gade gwang anuide daulu. Paul sinamedung de ngau keludau, pa Tinggwang de twa nah pecu teingkuu sütlu.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Anui Rome ga gwang luge, Paul de peu reugwame gede kwa eh pekatei lungh kera tei beudi.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Rome ga hebaangtei eh zierang ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Lang cumne cai Paul Jewme kak gade muiteu tei kebam minadung de qu hekwalu. Penui gwang ngkwa luge, pa penui dage rangdi, “Sinamedung, Ih minadung mede paupai zaidung de mmau eh magede teima, dede Jerusalem gade peu acu hebaangme ge tei eh Romme ba gage kai dida. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Penui acu keteu kelucai, penui acu lungmpet beu neudi, kedanemene a da tsailu kebui kie magede kegahne. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Dede Jewme mlai kedidau, acu peu Caesar dage a nzeu rangkera ketangdi, Ih a leuhme de magede mmau gai kera gah liede. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Cine aipau kiede ziemne, Ih nnuide qugai, nnuide kerengau eh ngngwa mpau kerane. Kedanemene Israelme keregui de ziemne acu hegeuria aide le kangpwa bam dida.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ge penui pe dage rangdi, “Anui Judea gade n ha laisiu gede ngaulu ma, mede anui sinamedung gwang maha gede paulia mede n ha kesia gede rang ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Dede nang aipau hemaade de daipai lie cet labi anui n dade siu gaineu bamlie, kedanemene kehei gade mina aipau maade de rang mmau kela anui cibam di delu.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Cine penui pe ziemne tingba riet luge, mina kekiee Paul kebam ni ga gwanglu. Pa penui dage pekie pwalia gai nah Tinggwang hegwangram ha zierang teigai. Pa tingcang gade tinghegi kecang Moses zai gade nah caihakecime laisiudung gade Jisu ha rangpwa penuide lia eh kecunggai. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Pa rang kegai samdung de kangge nlumlu dede kedame nlum luma. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Cidau penui hangge gede suizwalu mene kebam dau Paul ma aidungde rang kedi cai penui tetdi, “Kemci Rabe ne caihakecibe Isaiah dade nnui paumedung dage kerang de kesang da. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Pa rangdi, ‘Mie mina aidungde dage ranglo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“Nnui kingnei au kingnei zie, dede nnui ci gailak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">nah nnui pie au pie zie, dede nnui cet gailak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 6:9-10</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kedanemene mina aipau maadung de mlung mang bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nah penui kwen ma siusia dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nah penui miak ziangmui dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Iciu mecai penui miak le ma ngaulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nah penui kwen le siulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nah penui mlung le macilu eh nreugwang dailu kerabe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nah Ih penuide teingkei beuzie.”’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa. 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Ciziemne, Tinggwang kelikelu samlia aide Gentileme dage langgai dide lie kecu nnui ci lulo, nah penui kingnei luzie.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung kesa perwak 29 de sila. </char></note>[Pa ma aidungde rang dige, Jewme tetdi. Penuikatei penui kakgade kesamlimsüt eh bamdi].<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paul mmi kena ge mi ki ngngetlwe bamdi, nah pe da kegwang mileune de pa ngngwa redau. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Pa kuusüt eh Tinggwang hegwangram ha zierang tei nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista ha ledeu. Migede pecu kaam dima.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>